window.SLAMBOOK = [{"slug":"abby-mathew","name":"Abby Mathew","text":["He was elected the Mr. Personality of our batch for a reason. Spending his school life in a boys school, and yet gracefully managing to be dedicated to his studies staying on the right path without slipping away into those usual routes that warm blooded boys tend to take, he grew out to be a synonym for perfection and character. A man so reserved seen from afar, but friendly when you get a closer look.","Someone who is gentle enough to keep his nose off of others’ business. The man who stands as proud as the Empire State Building, who has a mystique persona that makes him stand out from the rest of the crowd. He isn’t your regular neighbourhood human. He isn’t yet another man you’d pass by. He’s that mysterious man who would take your brain for a roller coaster ride if you try to figure him out.","Abby Mathew, a man of discipline and perfection."],"photos":[[0,604,760,559],[0,1163,760,559],[0,1722,760,562]],"kid":null,"sprite":"abby-mathew.webp","size":[760,2284],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[118,5,598,598]},{"slug":"abdul-basith","name":"Abdul Basith","text":["Beaches, barbeques, and Basith – all go hand in hand. One latest ‘B’ has been added to the roster recently: Baby Basith. Basith believes that there is no shortcut to success. It is quite common for his friends to see him asking for Harrison’s latest edition the night before the exam, and enquiring what ‘a long case’ is, in the morning of the exam. We don’t yet know whether he owes it to the overflowing beard, but his friends can vouch for the fact that this is a man who has passed all exams till date through a divine intervention of some kind.","Born and brought up in the oil fields of Qatar this desi NRI often spend short vacations in his Arabian birth place. Although often misunderstood by people, he remains one of the most carefree guys in our batch. Always full of energy, going for tours, both small and huge, remains one of his favourite pass times. Years may pass by, and grey hairs may creep in to that bushy beard, but the smile and the mischief in his eyes will remain in our hearts, the Al Janko of 53rd batch."],"photos":[[0,604,574,422],[0,1026,760,556],[0,1582,760,557]],"kid":[0,2139,320,320],"sprite":"abdul-basith.webp","size":[760,2459],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[120,51,509,509]},{"slug":"abdul-jaleel","name":"Abdul Jaleel","text":["If other batches before 53rd were governed by presidents, ours was ruled by a king - the undisputed king of 53rd, ‘the rep’ Dr. Abdul Jaleel. With his specific skill set which enables him to impress anyone he meets, pick ‘em up, fold ‘em 4 times over, and place them in his pocket, his toy collection includes everyone right from the Principal to the ‘pacha-chechis’ in the wards. Born with a leadership gene, it did not take him long to be the leader of our batch.","None of us ever had to worry about exams, dates or anything official, thanks to this huge man. With a streak of hotheadedness that sometimes spells trouble, he is always a lively presence that demands attention. Democratic and autocratic in equal measure, he is known to take decisions that has mass popularity but vastly unpopular at times. Responsible, highly efficient and clockwork like, he becomes lazy and aloof once he reaches his den.","We owe this crazy man with crazy energy the ‘smoother than cream’ MBBS life we had."],"photos":[[0,604,760,556],[0,1160,760,560],[0,1720,760,557]],"kid":[0,2277,320,320],"sprite":"abdul-jaleel.webp","size":[760,2597],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[180,59,535,535]},{"slug":"abhinav-chandran","name":"Abhinav Chandran","text":["Every minute around “Dr”AbhinavChandran is truly alive. There is almost never a dull moment. Fondly known as ‘Kuttychathan’ among seniors; courtesy having a cool bro in 50th batch known to the world as ‘Chathan’, he was quick in moving out of his brother’s shadow, carving a niche for himself, getting renamed as “Gundan”. He is a tremendously talented artist, and undoubtedly the best dancer in the batch-he was a part of the college dance team.","He is also excellent with basketball and in boxing, though it remains unknown to the batch and CMC. His fabled telepathic relation with his teammates in the English Dumb charades is unrivalled. He can talk about anything under the sun seemingly authentically but whether it is true is another matter of debate. He has ‘done’ quite a lot of stuff in these few short yearsincluding recent achievements like a hundred orthopedic casts; assisting Dr.","Kuriakose in a CVTS surgery and older ones like attending a snake workshop in some remote Nagaland village and becoming the handwriting champion of Kerala. That said, this rotund bombshell of a man can take a bullet for his friends. He will be there to take part in your joy and share your sorrow. He will be truly missed by every 53rdian."],"photos":[[0,601,760,576],[0,1177,760,555],[0,1732,760,542]],"kid":[0,2274,320,318],"sprite":"abhinav-chandran.webp","size":[760,2592],"portrait":[0,0,760,601],"face":[456,102,228,228]},{"slug":"abin-mathew","name":"Abin Mathew","text":["This cool guy hails from the cool misty Wayanadan hills. Though blessed with a cute face and stylish hair, Mathai doesn’t give a damn about his good looks as he is rarely seen well groomed. It’s surprising that the electronic wave has yet to hit Mathai as he is rarely seen spending time with gadgets, and prefers to sleep instead. It’s rumored that he could be better contacted using the old school snail mail rather than using a phone.","He is also the mastermind behind all the excellent skits and spoofs our batch has produced. Mathai also has the reputation of working like a dog in the wards and still being kind enough to call that posting “very cool”. Being an achaayan, Mathai is no stranger to the vices achaayans indulge in. He is one of the coolest, and great to be with guys of the batch; our own Mathai."],"photos":[[0,603,635,671],[0,1274,760,551],[0,1825,760,556]],"kid":[0,2381,320,319],"sprite":"abin-mathew.webp","size":[760,2700],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[184,15,575,575]},{"slug":"abna-p-k","name":"Abna P K","text":["She kick-started by being the first “Lady Rep” of 53rd batch. Though she was handling such enormous responsibility for the first time, she did it with ease and style. That was how she got famous for her attitude (hope you all remember her notorious dialogues on-stage). The heights of charm was during her wedding when she looked like an angel who came straight from heaven. In the olden days of illiteracy of non-malayali batch mates, she took a major step in teaching Malayalam to them.","“Stay stubborn, stay smart” is her oxymoron punch line. Too few people know that she is a “papa’s kutti”, but she is adored equally well by friends and family. “Give respect and take respect” is her policy. Abna suggests, 53rd obeys."],"photos":[[0,607,760,556],[0,1163,542,399],[0,1562,760,560]],"kid":[0,2122,209,209],"sprite":"abna-p-k.webp","size":[760,2331],"portrait":[0,0,760,607],"face":[263,4,492,492]},{"slug":"adhil-m","name":"Adhil M","text":["Looks like Shahrukh, talks like Aamir, and plays like Messi’, this is what Adhil has to say about himself. First, coming to the Shahrukh Aamir part. “Tell them to get lost”, was the response from Adhil when he was cautioned against going out at noon on the first day in hostel, fearing falling prey to the hunting seniors. The boy who returned to fetch water from the downstairs cooler returned early morning the next day, battered, but ‘ahankaram’whole, and fully in place.","Each and every system in the world – everything right from our college, politics, film, music, USA, other world nations, even probably the solar system as such is imperfect in his opinion - system’s fault; only perfection is him and himself alone. Still he won’t swat a mosquito sitting on his cheek – because, it is the sanitation system and municipality’s fault; not his. A neatness freak, he has been approached by Dermatology department to honour him with an award for the most consultations in a calendar year.","Now about the Messi part; he is the self proclaimed captain and lead striker of our batch team which has the record of not having not scored even once against an opposition in the last 6 years. Now, jokes apart, this handsome guy is the pulse of his group. Carefree and fun loving, he loves to live life to the fullest. He will be sorely missed by any one who had the chance to get to know him."],"photos":[[0,606,760,560],[0,1166,760,560],[0,1726,760,557]],"kid":[0,2283,320,320],"sprite":"adhil-m.webp","size":[760,2603],"portrait":[0,0,760,606],"face":[104,0,606,606]},{"slug":"adithya-g-l","name":"Adithya G L","text":["53rd had a title of “Gifted Hands” in art, here’s our girl; for she brought home a major number of awards in interbatch’s offstage art events. Overflowing with talent, her melodious voice caught the attention of many with her unforgettable rendition of “vennilachandhanakinnam” in 1st year. Hailing from Balussery, her peculiar slang and pronunciations of certain words as “bae-g”(bag), “peth-ology”(pathology), “doct”(doctor...","God knows where in Balussery the “or” of “doctor” disappeared!) and use of the word “reddikkum”(sherikkum) umpteen times in a sentence is a source of leg pulling for her buddies. Extremely beauty conscious, she has a constellation of beauty products ranging from ‘Amma’s kaachiya enna’, and kasthoori manjal to Dove and Lakme’s products! Though bold at sight, her agreeable nod to anything and flutter of tension at the littlest of things, prove the innocence of her innerself and makes her the most loved one of her gang.","With her innocent smile, this beauty with her ochrous hue and silky midnight black locks owns a heart so warm and mild as any spring morning."],"photos":[[0,607,760,556],[0,1163,640,477],[0,1640,760,560]],"kid":[0,2200,320,319],"sprite":"adithya-g-l.webp","size":[760,2519],"portrait":[0,0,760,607],"face":[152,19,427,427]},{"slug":"afsal-aboobacker-bapputty-haji","name":"Afsal Aboobacker Bapputty Haji","text":["Afsal Aboobacker Bapputty Haji, or simply Bapputty, a big man with a bigger name and an even bigger heart. He is a man of contradictions. Mature and childish simultaneously, Bapputty is the master planner and ultimate businessman, with a foresight so far that he might have already made the will for his unborn children. Maybe all his planning is done in sleep, because, this guy sleeps 18 hours a day.","The erstwhile sleep king turned GP king now serve whole of north Malabar, and his GP doubts can make even Dr. PKS scratch his head. Joker, Hannibal, Gabbar Singh, and Stephen - the most iconic villains of our lifetime, we can be proud that the last one was made immortal by Bapputty in the epic movie “Nizhalchithrangal”. His name can evoke a tide of memories in our mind, right from the Physio lab demos to the batch tours.","A red monkey cap, a pair of Rayban shades and a checkered belt can make you smile and think ‘ah… Bapputty’. You can’t find a man more sincere in what he does. If there is a job to be done, you can leave it to him and rest assured (paisa chilappo koodiyekkum). Jovial, sincere, helpful and fully family oriented, the name Bapputty will always bring nothing but joy to our minds."],"photos":[[0,607,760,560],[0,1167,760,560],[0,1727,760,560]],"kid":[0,2287,320,318],"sprite":"afsal-aboobacker-bapputty-haji.webp","size":[760,2605],"portrait":[0,0,760,607],"face":[2,0,607,607]},{"slug":"aishwarya-raj","name":"Aishwarya Raj","text":["Some people believe that Aishwarya can win the cuteness contest competing with kittens. Little do they know that she can win any singing contest as well. Her friends find in her a solid person whom you can count on. Those who have seen her true self behind the serious fascade will swear that she is the best when it comes to punch dialogues. Above all, she is a family girl, who values her parents over anything.","It is funny to see her being polite and tensed at the same time. Earlier on, she was never to be seen in the campus outside class hours. But towards the end of MBBS she made CMC library her second home during offhours with her born passion for medicine. We believe that she will go for and fetch numerous degrees. She once met a tough guy in library. Rest is legend, folks."],"photos":[[0,604,760,560],[0,1164,760,565],[0,1729,760,560]],"kid":[0,2289,320,320],"sprite":"aishwarya-raj.webp","size":[760,2609],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[66,0,604,604]},{"slug":"aiswarya-gopalakrishnan","name":"Aiswarya Gopalakrishnan","text":["For the silent ones with the theory of “mounam vidhvaanu bhooshanam”, heres the one who follows it thoroughly. No one has heard Aiswarya speak much, except the walls of her room. She keeps a distance from those who dont her much, but if she gets comfortable (which is highly rare) she is a talkative, funloving girl. Although, we consider her a silent bee, if she enters the field of books and academics, Aiswarya transforms into a radio!","Her favourite leisure time activities are watching movies and reading books. Being a voracious reader, she will literally gobble up any book that crosses her path. And yes, academics are a super priority to this above average hardworker. Described rightly as the tall, lean girl with wide eyes and long hair who loves traditions, this girl is a showstopper for her amazing wardrobe and err proof dressing.","Silence lavishly used and smartness wisely used, thats Aiswarya. G."],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,760,535],[0,1698,760,566]],"kid":[0,2264,320,320],"sprite":"aiswarya-gopalakrishnan.webp","size":[760,2584],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[246,53,237,237]},{"slug":"akarsh-c-a","name":"Akarsh C A","text":["If you ever feel low self-esteem and that life is not worth living, we suggest you go meet this guy. You will come out feeling “njanitravalyasambhavamayirunno”. Such are the piping powers vested in “Topper” sometimes also known as Akarsh. There is more to him than meets the eye. He is cute and handsome, and could give a tough fight for any model in a fair and lovely ad. When he says something, be assured its only half of the whole story, because there is always some mystery with this guy.","Very particular about his dressing, he won’t take a stride without his beloved woodland, even be it to the ICH. You always have to keep an eye on him, because the moment you lose sight of him, he elopes away with his textbooks. He is silent and humble, yet makes a strong impression when he wants to."],"photos":[[0,602,538,394],[0,996,640,477],[0,1473,760,560]],"kid":[0,2033,147,146],"sprite":"akarsh-c-a.webp","size":[760,2179],"portrait":[0,0,760,602],"face":[319,98,288,288]},{"slug":"akhil-m","name":"Akhil M","text":["The first appearance of Akhil M Velayudhan was in a tight pant, with countless pockets, long hair and an umbrella hung behind the back of his shirt. At times a controversial figure, he divides opinions. Popularly known as Kondotty, he is the first house surgeon in South India to watch Korean movies with Russian subtitles and write Malayalam reviews about them. He has been the mastermind behind every event held in our batch as well as a number of college events.","We had a batch anniversary, a batch logo, a batch t-shirt, thanks to this man. Handling the camera, editing and technical aspects of every program in CMC, he was indispensible even for the 49th and 50th convocations. In spite of all of this, you might not be able to find him in our batch photo for some mysterious reason. He loves travelling, and is a recognizable online presence, always dishing out opinions to his faithful following.","We can say without a shadow of doubt, that our batch will not be the same without Kondotty."],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,760,557],[0,1720,760,557]],"kid":[0,2277,320,320],"sprite":"akhil-m.webp","size":[760,2597],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[126,7,435,435]},{"slug":"akhil-raghavan","name":"Akhil Raghavan","text":["Known as Raghavan, hails from Kannur. He has all the qualities of being a kannur-kaaran. Hot blooded comrade, and a soft hearted friend and brother, he is always willing to extend a helping hand to his mates. He is one of the few honest and sincere guys in the batch who is not afraid to speak the truth. Passionate about football, he was also a great player and also the best batsman in the batch - the Vivian Richards of 53rd.","Raghavan also doesnt mind being carried away by his passions, be it anything. That’s how Raghavan is impulsive at times but still a kind man and a good friend. Being one among the djangos, Raghavan still managed to be a teacher’s favourite."],"photos":[[0,604,760,560],[0,1164,760,554],[0,1718,760,560]],"kid":null,"sprite":"akhil-raghavan.webp","size":[760,2278],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[103,38,429,429]},{"slug":"aleena-joseph","name":"Aleena Joseph","text":["Jovial is the most apt word to describe our Alee. Always cool and sming, she flies smoothly from one task to another as a dove. Alee is totally funny and as sweet as a candy. Her biggest weakness-oh sorry, author is still confused to sort it out-singing Sarigama or pleading to all 53rd dance masters to train her in the infamous ‘Thithai thaaha’ dance moves or fashion shows and ramps which excites her nerves.","Though her innocence is one that can beat a baby, she also has a credited number of ‘Bondatharams’ which 53rd batch would be soon publishing under the title ‘Aleenayude phalithangal’. She is the rarest species who has mastered the sport of ‘soft ball’, as this is the only item which sinks to her softness. She lives inside her own cocoon and is totally unaware of the world around her-eg: she even patiently waits for a bus to arrive on a harthal day!!!.","Her ‘Butler english’ actually takes you to a state of disorientation where both listener and herself has lost connection between phases. She is the sole owner of silky straight hair without any chemical touch. Tall and lean_ this cute girl remain as one and only sports woman of 53rd."],"photos":[[0,604,760,560],[0,1164,720,537],[0,1701,658,485]],"kid":[0,2186,320,320],"sprite":"aleena-joseph.webp","size":[760,2506],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[244,69,425,425]},{"slug":"ali-shabith","name":"Ali Shabith","text":["Weighing in over 200 pounds, making his way from metropolitan Thamarassery, thadiyan is literally the heavyweight of our batch. Despite what his size and looks suggest, he is a child at heart. He never wastes an opportunity to tease others and show off that he has the best of whatever he owns; starting with the Carl- Zeiss enabled n73 all the way to the 13mp selfies that he may never use.","Behind that bearded baby face is an A-type personality who likes to keep his life and everything in it in order, preferably sorted out alphabetically. At the other end he could also win the ‘being lazy’ competition. Be that as it may, he is able to liven up a group with some crazy ass energy that he conjures out of who knows where. A fan of shakes of all kind, he can gulp them down like a machine.","And he sings... maybe... or not. When he puts his mind to it, there is nothing he can’t do. One thing is for sure, anyone who has ever come across our Thadiyan will never forget him."],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,760,560],[0,1723,760,560]],"kid":[0,2283,318,320],"sprite":"ali-shabith.webp","size":[760,2603],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[209,50,275,275]},{"slug":"alwin-antony","name":"Alwin Antony","text":["Oru prathyeka manushyan... that is Alwin. He is the ultimate talking machine, never running out of topics to talk about. Finding a higher realm of happiness in travelling and driving, he is a pleasure to hang out with. His decisions are his own and never lets others influence his views. This independent character is one of his strong suits. Sleeping and eating makes up the other end, which isn’t that rare an entity amongst us medicos.","In those rare occasions when he stops talking, he plans. Plans that can make or break this world. With all that power comes great responsibility and Alwin is well suited to handle it."],"photos":[[0,601,760,560],[0,1161,760,562],[0,1723,760,559]],"kid":[0,2282,320,320],"sprite":"alwin-antony.webp","size":[760,2602],"portrait":[0,0,760,601],"face":[208,40,338,338]},{"slug":"ambika-premarajan","name":"Ambika Premarajan","text":["Rightly termed “The Vagabond”, Ambi is the fearless nomad who has spent one third of her life in hostels and paying guest homes (we think the explanation is that she was too intelligent to live like us normal people). Never too serious or anxious, she is like a happy bunny. Smiling at her own jokes, singing every now and then to traumatise the neighbourhood, sleeping like a fully fed feline-she is nothing short of entertainment.","Bearing the lyrics of just one song (Ambalappuzhae), she is fearless to sing every other song no matter how wild the tune turns at her tonguetip! Her passion to sleeping is such that she ensures no interruptions, which probably explains why she sleeps with her eyes open; to scare the hell out of anyone who dares to awaken her! Her art of talking without grammatical error even while sleeping is still an amazement to many.","A hardcore Mohanlal fan, her talk contains well memorised and revised dialogues of Lalettan that she recites at appropriate circumstances like a faithful follower. It wasnt long before cupid struck her with a ‘Romedy arrow’ and voilà, from ‘humorous’ she has now triumphed to ‘hilarious’ with her better half by her side. Though her funny side is just the sugar coating, the ultimate flavour of Ambika’s sweetness lies in the sincere and loyal friend that she is.","Cheers to 53rd’s Ambi!"],"photos":[[0,604,760,560],[0,1164,760,560],[0,1724,760,560]],"kid":[0,2284,320,318],"sprite":"ambika-premarajan.webp","size":[760,2602],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[162,14,505,505]},{"slug":"ameena-shagal-s","name":"Ameena Shagal S","text":["With her obvious Kannur language of ‘ettheena-poyeena’(came, went), this girl is the on-the -dot responder with her ‘uruleykupperi’. Titled as ‘Atypical Ameena’, the majority crowd’s choice at taste is not Ameena’s pick. While we savour tastes that touch our tastebuds, Ameena savours tastes that only touch her heart. She is even choosey amongst home made delicacies. In fact if you choose to offer her a chocolate, she is open to convey her dislike to nuts or raisins, and accepts only the purest form of plain milk chocolate.","Such is the level of genuinity that she offers her tastebuds. Unniyappams’ are like heartbeats for Ameena, and now Calicut’s Newtops Bakery has a delivery package only and only for her. If you were to bribe Ameena, food or a lovingly made biryani would suffice. Simply saying, skilfully made food is the gate to her heart. Although bold on the outer cover, Ameena is oversensitive and emotional on the inside.","And she never is afraid to express her dislike. Of Ameena’s greatest skills, she sees only what she needs when ‘the time comes’. Even if the brightest of objects flicker within a distance of 20cms from her eyes, Ameena can see it only 5 minutes later. Ophthalmologists are still baffled by this undiagnosed form of near blindness. and Ameena refuses to call this impatience! With her wide variety of clothes, thanks to her brother’s textile shop, her wardrobe is extensive, and so the rule is never to repeat a dress within a month.","Decisive and outspoken, this girl is never afraid to express her open views about anything that she is asked for."],"photos":[[0,603,760,556],[0,1159,544,667]],"kid":[0,1826,320,320],"sprite":"ameena-shagal-s.webp","size":[760,2146],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[124,37,381,381]},{"slug":"amjad-pm","name":"Amjad PM","text":["Whistles and smiles are what you will remember when you think about Amjad. Care free and cool, he was voted Mr. Smile in the first year, and he has used it to his advantage on a number of occasions. Always willing to try something new, he even had the nerves to try a hand in solo male dance in inter batch competition. The rest was history. He truly believes in the phrase ‘impossible is nothing’, and always gets what he wants through sheer will power and hard work.","Responsible and mature, he has come a long way from the kid in in first year to the man he is now. His positive attitude and will power is sure to propel him to great heights."],"photos":[[0,603,760,556],[0,1159,760,560],[0,1719,760,560]],"kid":[0,2279,320,320],"sprite":"amjad-pm.webp","size":[760,2599],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[107,31,503,503]},{"slug":"anagha-s","name":"Anagha S","text":["Typical Malayali Manka of 53rd batch, with the captivating scent of ‘Kaachiya Enna’, who is soft spoken and walks in fear of hurting Mother earth. Her presence may be invisible to many because she knows that for each and every activity we need energy and even talking unnecessary can cause depletion of this energy. She may have been quiet good at physics, but she is not stingy in radiating her energy in the form of her beautiful smile.","In fact, her unitmates have marked the day that she spoke to them as a milestone in her speech development in CMC. She loves her home to the extent that she beat PT Usha’s record in running to catch the bus after postings. Even if time passes at the speed of light, she would be doing this in her style of perfectionism, without compromising. Slow and steady wins the race is her prime agenda."],"photos":[[0,605,760,560],[0,1165,760,560],[0,1725,603,444]],"kid":[0,2169,320,320],"sprite":"anagha-s.webp","size":[760,2489],"portrait":[0,0,760,605],"face":[284,21,209,209]},{"slug":"anjali-krishnanandan","name":"Anjali Krishnanandan","text":["Lovingly called ‘Aakri’ by her besties, she has no resemblance to her archaeological artefact nickname. One of the most silent, polite girls of 53rd, you would find her sitting at her constant seat in the second row of Saju-be it during a lecture class or during a batch GB to evaluate the inadequacy of beet root in ICH cutlet! With her beautiful eyes and soft voice, many a times you would sit wondering if many of the old Malayalam songs about “Shaleena soundaryam” were sung about her.","Her child-like innocence and the tendency to being overtly sensitive for even a subthreshold stimulus has earned her another title- ‘younger sister of Mimosa pudica’. She is always a storehouse of wonder, be it the sudden revelation of hitherto unexpected dancing skills or her uncanny ability to crack jokes and remain silent as though nothing happened. Scooter, Home, Books-pretty much sums up Anjali’s routine."],"photos":[[0,604,623,670],[0,1274,760,560]],"kid":[0,1834,317,320],"sprite":"anjali-krishnanandan.webp","size":[760,2154],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[181,28,435,435]},{"slug":"anjali-p-u","name":"Anjali P U","text":["When you wander through the corridors of HSQ at odd hours and if you hear nasal twanged voices speaking unknown tongue, don’t be scared-that is Anjali. An oft quoted ancedote among her friends is that Kim ki-Duk consults her for opinion about his next films!. Fondly called PU/Poo by nears and dears, this tall statured lady is the honour of a wonderful personality which will leave you with a smile whenever you think of her.","She is a family girl through and through, so much that every other weekend, you will find her in trips with her family. Always found in triples with her two bloodies on each side, rumors are that the reason behind her famous ‘blush’ is an extra bloody. She is one of the few with exceptional academic sword who considers the day as wasted if it doesn’t involve a trip, treat or movie!","She knows how best to be at the academic peak and create fun being there!"],"photos":[[0,604,760,560],[0,1164,760,562],[0,1726,760,560]],"kid":[0,2286,316,320],"sprite":"anjali-p-u.webp","size":[760,2606],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[87,25,503,503]},{"slug":"anjana-c","name":"Anjana C","text":["Hardwork never kills is anjanas motto. But why take the risk? So she has limited her hardwork only to studies. She is one of the kuthist dayscholars who has failed to fail in any of the exams she appeared for! Though often called ‘suppandi’ by her close friends for her prominentjawline, Anjana’s brain is light years away from suppandi’s. She is ready for any adventures. She may go as far as rope walking and bungee jumping if situation permits-such is her muscle and mind power.","Dont ever fancy winning a bet with her. Dont even imagine picking up an arguement, either. She is famous for her “never mind”attitude. She can constitute an “ottayal pattalam” on her own and shed missiles to bring any one to their knees. Armed with her scooty, this combo package of ‘muscles and brain’will never let you stop wandering about her awe and strength."],"photos":[[0,607,602,444],[0,1051,760,560]],"kid":[0,1611,320,320],"sprite":"anjana-c.webp","size":[760,1931],"portrait":[0,0,760,607],"face":[86,38,522,522]},{"slug":"anju-joy","name":"Anju Joy","text":["One of the troubles with having more than two with the same name in a batch is that your father is better known than yourself. Joyous, generous, and jolly, Anju has proved the aptness of her surname. A total ‘friends’ person, she would mesmerise you with millions of tales of her many friends and you would be left wondering how could one have so many friends! One of the advantages of having Anju as your buddy is the frequent invitations you get to her house and the mouthwatering delicacies her mother prepares.","She will amaze you with her range of personalities; you will find her playing scrabble with her next door LKG kid, the next moment she can give CPR to a dying patient. She faced the final year exams with the coolness of a school test. Once found crisscrossing near LH and found next time on roadside for repair, Anju’s car presently runs in nothing less than 100mph."],"photos":[[0,607,760,560],[0,1167,760,560]],"kid":[0,1727,205,204],"sprite":"anju-joy.webp","size":[760,1931],"portrait":[0,0,760,607],"face":[233,46,372,372]},{"slug":"anju-kesavan-m-p","name":"Anju Kesavan M P","text":["The ‘veeragadha’ of this “Unniyarcha” begins right from 1st year, when she sat cross-legged reading a newspaper in front of hostel warden, BB. She acted as the mastermind behind ‘Poochamandi’ poem, which later rose to fame in CMC. She has earned considerable number of ‘get outs’ for reasons as trivial as borrowing a pen from HOD. She is the nightmare for traffic policemen who has her own rules for crossing the road.","Anju’s life, in short, is a festival of madness, innocence, adventures and friendship. She is the Django or the absolute ‘freak’ CMC has ever seen. The proverb ‘empty vessels make much noise’ holds true for Anju. She keeps absolutely nothing in her heart even though she is a chatter box outwardly. At the end of every foolish act, this girl will give you an apology in Manjeri slang and flash her classic ‘innocent smile’ which can make even Hitler shed tears.","Anju ignores what other people think about her and lives on with her typical sense of humor. Hats off to this mischievous, notorious, pretty lady!"],"photos":[[0,606,760,557],[0,1163,519,382],[0,1545,760,560]],"kid":[0,2105,320,320],"sprite":"anju-kesavan-m-p.webp","size":[760,2425],"portrait":[0,0,760,606],"face":[97,16,484,484]},{"slug":"anju-k-k","name":"Anju K K","text":["For 53rd’s sportswing, here is another undug sportswoman. Mastering discus throw at district level, this athlete is a story to unravel. Being an academic smartypants, she was titled as a doctor since school itself thanks to her classic handwriting. With her crazy fashion ideas of a little frontfringe hairstyle, this shopaholic is a careful one. Three dresses a time is her motto, of which 2 will be yellow and even still, she’ll wear a dress till its threads fall out!","Yellow is her heart’s addiction and Anju makes sure she has a yellow dress for every season. Of her interests, aimless wandering is first. Second, the irresistable urge to photograph anything that crosses her way ever since mobiles ever had cameras! She has had a Delhi native (Ankur)as her lab mate since 1st year, now Ankur speaks malayalam but Anju knows not even a word in hindi!","If socialisation was established in academics, Anju would be the forerunner because she is a member of a multiple number of combi sets. Football is like chocolate to her, she never misses any football match no matter what exam she has. Daring as she is, she dismisses anyone from attempting to dominate her. With the guts to leave work thats not her’s to PGs, Anju is well bent to never do even one percent of extra work thats not hers.","Although she appears tough on the outside, Anju is the sensitive sort in truth."],"photos":[[0,603,688,671],[0,1274,760,560],[0,1834,760,560]],"kid":[0,2394,319,320],"sprite":"anju-k-k.webp","size":[760,2714],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[331,92,127,127]},{"slug":"ankur","name":"Ankur","text":["He is our northie cutie pie, and being the youngest member of our family, Ankur is loved by everyone. He sure may look cute, but there is nothing cute about him when you are facing him in the basketball court, where he unleashes his tougher side. Ankur also love movies and has a grand collection to boast. It is surely amazing how he has blended beautifully into the mallu group, and now has a fluent speech in malayalam, something he would take home with pride.","All in all, he is this lovable “kiddo”, our dear Dillywala brother."],"photos":[[0,604,631,466],[0,1070,759,559],[0,1629,760,560]],"kid":[0,2189,320,320],"sprite":"ankur.webp","size":[760,2509],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[152,18,372,372]},{"slug":"annie-joseph","name":"Annie Joseph","text":["There wouldn’t be anyone who has fought and shed tears for 53rd batch except for Annie. Her name echoes during batch programs, interbatch fest and jesus youth events. If you have a team, either in sports or arts (or whatever else it may be) and you are one person short of completing it, you can complete it by adding Annie. She has got a point mutation due to which she leaves behind something wherever she goes that makes her return to the same place again.","So, if you want to trace her path, just look out for her phone, purse or umbrella. She has got so much stuff in her head (we guess, batch issues)that she is always wants a P. A to remind her of everything. She follows an all-or-none-law in that either she is a dedicated & true friend or just a passing acquaintance. Her true batch spirit emerged when she made IMCH the native place of her little one.","She is also known as the most hardworking hostel sec."],"photos":[[0,603,760,556],[0,1159,760,560],[0,1719,760,560]],"kid":[0,2279,320,320],"sprite":"annie-joseph.webp","size":[760,2599],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[157,0,603,603]},{"slug":"anu-k-a","name":"Anu K A","text":["Thanks to her name, the only female of 53rd to be referred to by an elder male’s suffix is our very own ‘anuka’. She has the best quality of a student-”doubts “. Anu has a million doubts about anything under the sun. Although very often it leaves the questioned person in the confusion of whether to laugh or cry. Of her achievements, she has had the most variety and maximum number of combi-study-mates through 5 years of her MBBS life.","Anu is the impersonation of selflessness. Her bed, study table and anything of her’s are showpieces for her and personal items for her room mates. She hence established the fact that one mustnt bring too many quality stuff to hostel because “aarelumokke adhil keri nirangum!”For Anu, aprocrastination is not to join in an event but to get out of it. If anything is planned, Anu’s bulb of realisation flicks only close to the D-day and she steps out of an event at the very last minute.","As a student, nothing can pull Anu away from books, not even food. She plans a month ahead for an exam and can snap through an exam like its peanuts. With her wobbly smile and innocent heart, Anuka is the ideal hostelmate and friend to many."],"photos":[[0,511,680,671],[0,1182,760,560],[0,1742,760,560]],"kid":[0,2302,320,320],"sprite":"anu-k-a.webp","size":[760,2622],"portrait":[0,0,639,511],"face":[29,0,511,511]},{"slug":"anupama-ramachandran","name":"Anupama Ramachandran","text":["She is the brain of 53rd batch. She has won every medical quiz known to mankind!!!!!! Analyzing her family history we conclude that her affinity to medicine is genetic, not acquired. She is never known to get angry with anyone, therefore there is a special place in hell for who ever who gets angry with anupama. Though her car is littered with medical books in the inside and “crow PGs on the outside she loves it as if it’s a baby. her passion apart from singing is locking the key securely within her car and later bringing workshop personnel to retrieve it.","She can teach you nuances of Carnatic raga as easy as recalling the mechanism of action of natalizumab. Cmc Is proud to have witnessed her transformation from a short haired little girl to an all capable doctor. We all love Anupama for the humble and simple girl she is…"],"photos":[[0,603,319,235],[0,838,760,560],[0,1398,760,560]],"kid":[0,1958,320,320],"sprite":"anupama-ramachandran.webp","size":[760,2278],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[218,33,258,258]},{"slug":"aparna-premarajan","name":"Aparna Premarajan","text":["Being the soft eyed beauty that she is, Aparna is the typical ‘lady doctor with grace’. This shelled up doll was the ‘Ms. Batch’ runner up of 53rd. Being soft spoken, she loves to enjoy life and every moment with her friends. Bold at her own decisions, she carries an element of feminism within her heart. She is a silent comforter and a trustworthy friend to her near ones. If there are two things you could bribe Aparna with, one would be pizza and the other would be crazily driving without a destination.","Extremely diplomatic in her opinions, everything is fair and acceptable in Aparna’s eyes. Not even a human error in its unforgivable form can nudge Aparna from the loyalty of her friendship. Although quiet to the outside world, this beauty is a bundle of talent. She is the owner of a melodious voice and an amazing dancer. Rightly described as a colourful butterfly who prefers to be in her cocoon rather than flying out; Aparna is a vision of grace."],"photos":[[0,611,760,560],[0,1171,760,560],[0,1731,760,560]],"kid":[0,2291,320,320],"sprite":"aparna-premarajan.webp","size":[760,2611],"portrait":[0,0,760,611],"face":[92,27,465,465]},{"slug":"archana-della-thomas","name":"Archana Della Thomas","text":["Archana, fondly called “Della” by her favourite teachers (whom she has found favour with by being the walking anatomy atlas)belongs to that category of kids who use only Grays, Parson, Hutchinson and if possible, great Grandfather Robbins. This being the scene, a portion of this travelholic’s shelf is still reserved for “Yathra magazine” subscription.”How to learn cooking” is something she has been experimenting on in the recent past.","This silent little lady has a strong passion for surgical specialities, which went up to waking up her roommates to observe emergency appendicectomy in the middle of a 3rd sem night! Apart from a few radiological changes recently, the way this enthusiastic doctor cuts and sews is sure to make her a great surgeon in future."],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,760,564],[0,1727,760,560]],"kid":[0,2287,320,320],"sprite":"archana-della-thomas.webp","size":[760,2607],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[248,52,205,205]},{"slug":"arjith-c-s","name":"Arjith C S","text":["If there is one voice that resonate amongst us 53rdians, it is that of Arjith’s. And it gets pretty loud too... way loud. He is the true ‘Mappila’ of our batch with a Malappuram diction that spreads beyond generations. Always open and constantly talking, his spontaneous mood shifts make him a ‘nimishakavi’. When he is not conjuring poems out of thin air, he unleashes his extensive collection of mappilpatukal.","When it gets all too dull, he plays shuttle and runs marathons, bagging prizes. Always well connected with juniors, his batch spirit is second to none. Truly the Mr. Voice of our batch."],"photos":[[0,603,467,344],[0,947,540,616],[0,1563,760,560]],"kid":[0,2123,245,245],"sprite":"arjith-c-s.webp","size":[760,2368],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[180,185,285,285]},{"slug":"arun-c-v","name":"Arun C V","text":["Fearless, audacious, ultra-aggressive and extremely eccentric. Born in a doctor family, it was not difficult for him to choose a path cleared by his parents before. Popular by the name CV, he is not everyone’s cup of tea. People find it hard to digest him, and he is rarely seen in and around the campus. This may be the reason he has not made as many connections as he should have, here in the campus.","But his ultra-huge friends circle outside easily compensate for this. Often bringing colourful characters like ‘motor’,’rotor’,’cutter’ and‘screwdriver’ you never know what he is up to. CV is memorable for his performance in the intra batch football league in the 2nd year, where he ended up top scorer. He is also said to be brilliant in some bourgeois games like snooker, golf and billiards.","The unrecognisable, immense physical transformation that he underwent in the past 5 years is also worth remembering (he literally went from a golf ball to a bowling ball). Many won’t know this guy personally, but for those who know, he is someone you won’t forget easily....."],"photos":[[0,611,554,671],[0,1282,760,560],[0,1842,760,560]],"kid":[0,2402,261,260],"sprite":"arun-c-v.webp","size":[760,2662],"portrait":[0,0,760,611],"face":[338,212,233,233]},{"slug":"arun-m","name":"Arun M","text":["A run M, or simply M, is someone thoroughly misunderstood by many, to be silent and ‘good’. But once you get to know him, a world of possibilities open up. He has that knack of killing off people with witty one-liners. With an uncanny ability to bust out stress from stressful situations, you can put him in a courtroom drama and just like that, tension will be gone. He loves to appreciate beauty in any form.","‘Arunettan’ is also the heart throb of few students who happened to work under his tutelage in the labour room. It came as a shock to his friends when it was revealed late in house surgeoncy that he was trained in classical dance and it made us look at all those inter batch performances in a new light. Funny, jovial, vibrant and dashing, he has given us memories to cherish for a long time."],"photos":[[0,602,760,560],[0,1162,760,555],[0,1717,760,560]],"kid":[0,2277,320,320],"sprite":"arun-m.webp","size":[760,2597],"portrait":[0,0,760,602],"face":[87,188,315,315]},{"slug":"arunnath-k","name":"Arunnath K","text":["Nath is one of his kind, one of the techies of our batch, and is the one to contact to know about the latest software and electronic gadgets. Nath is unique in every sense. When everyone rides a motor bike, Nath rides his bicycle through the campus and he ain’t shy to take it to the town. Such is the stamina of this guy, and he is also the only guy to participate in marathons from our batch.","Nath is also fond of fighter fishes and his aquarium has always had one, since second year, again a very unique hobby. Nath is also a keen movie watcher patiently watching even the most boring of movies and finding his own interpretations of it. Be it looks, clothing, style or attitude, everything about this guy is what you call “order in disorder”."],"photos":[[0,601,760,560],[0,1161,598,441],[0,1602,720,532]],"kid":[0,2134,320,320],"sprite":"arunnath-k.webp","size":[760,2454],"portrait":[0,0,760,601],"face":[142,3,423,423]},{"slug":"arun-nirmal","name":"Arun Nirmal","text":["He always has this composed reservation about him, as if planning something big. But more the time you spend with him, the better it gets. It’s like peeling an onion without all the tears. It gets better with each layer... wrong comparison maybe. But he has his stages. From being reserved to jolly to being a total hothead that often spell trouble. He has kept himself well connected with all the batches, actively organizing and participating in various college activities in both the political and cultural scene.","In the later years he has been obsessed with bulking up, seeking out venues beyond the college gym. He loves travelling just like anybody else, but open windowed buses are his thing. And he loves Mountain Dew, drinking it like water and saving the bottles for an unforeseen bottle shortage in the future. And when things get nasty, he whips out his hockey stick and goes hunting. You have to take a few shots with this guy, but when you do hit it right, you are going to have a world of fun."],"photos":[[0,604,760,560],[0,1164,584,421],[0,1585,760,560]],"kid":[0,2145,320,320],"sprite":"arun-nirmal.webp","size":[760,2465],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[223,114,199,199]},{"slug":"arun-radhakrishnan","name":"Arun Radhakrishnan","text":["As the world fell into chaos and evil took over, one man fought against the tyranny of the devil, with textbooks in his right hand and the love of his life on the other. His hardened self, aka Mr. Tough could give any rocks a run for their money. Beyond the seemingly unbreakable shell is a man who values the endurance rating of everything he comes across. His pursuit for ultimate power sets him apart from the general crowd.","As he laid waste over the numerous textbooks in his medical course, he became the silent pillar of knowledge and power. He fights hard against injustice, though his method of delivering swift justice may not be everyone’s cup of tea. As the hard man ‘Radha’ rides off into the sunset, only time will tell you of his conquests yet to come."],"photos":[[0,602,760,560],[0,1162,760,560],[0,1722,760,560]],"kid":[0,2282,320,320],"sprite":"arun-radhakrishnan.webp","size":[760,2602],"portrait":[0,0,760,602],"face":[124,19,408,408]},{"slug":"arun-vadakkumpat","name":"Arun Vadakkumpat","text":["AV, Vadaku, Kaala...and Kaal... his names are plenty. A sweet guy who often has difficulty making up his mind or making it up one too many times, he is a dependable rock solid amigo. He has one of the best handwritings in our batch and sings like a pro too. Perhaps that’s why he has fans in all the batches. And some specific fans will always have their some specific story to tell... aah... that is going to take more pages than this book can hold to tell.","He is a huge cricket fan, who plays badminton a lot and cooks on the side. And yes, he cooks well, really well. And he sleeps well too, so good that he chose sleep over a little university exam that didn’t turn out for the better. It is sad AV photography never took off; then again you can’t have them all. Save for the occasional shopping munchies and experiments with the hair style, you really can’t go wrong with Vadakkumpat."],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,584,421],[0,1584,760,560]],"kid":[0,2144,320,320],"sprite":"arun-vadakkumpat.webp","size":[760,2464],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[86,0,530,530]},{"slug":"arya-preman","name":"Arya Preman","text":["Being the vibrant dancer of 53rd batch, Dr ARYA PREMAN is an inevitable ingredient of any 53rd dance programme. She is enthusiastic and energetic in whatever she does. She is so passionate about dance that she imagines herself dancing when she simply listens to a song. Her magic in cooking is well known amongst hostellers and she is the food basket of 53rd. Like a “thottavaadi”, she is sensitive, gentle and an emotional queen who describes her emotions only in English.","The craziest thing about ARYA is her “selfie mania” that she’d even take a selfie with any patient cured by her. Instead of a cat or bird as a pet, she treats her mobile phone as one. She is always “Rangeen” in what she wears and knows how to flaunt it with the right accessories. Grace and beauty balanced, once found, she is your friend forever."],"photos":[[0,605,760,496],[0,1101,760,532],[0,1633,760,564]],"kid":[0,2197,320,320],"sprite":"arya-preman.webp","size":[760,2517],"portrait":[0,0,760,605],"face":[78,4,476,476]},{"slug":"ashish-nair","name":"Ashish Nair","text":["The “Delhi Belly” of 53rd batch. There’s the attitude of this guy that none can beat, quickly god recognized in the batch which earned him few infamous posts in the mini fresher’s. Ashish is the kind of guy who would describe an ant with an elephant’s might, “Badaayi” the short word in Malayalam. Basketball is his weakness, the last of the emperors in the dynasty which would contain legends like Jaggu and Bosco.","Claims to be a multi-instrumentalist, he must be the guy who tried out the most number of musical instruments in our batch; started out with drums, then the guitar, the bass and - oh wait… he also sang a song in the end!!!! He has also played a role as band manager of the official 53rd band. Ashish is just the type of sweet n sour flavour you wish in a dish."],"photos":[[0,601,760,560],[0,1161,760,551],[0,1712,760,560]],"kid":[0,2272,282,282],"sprite":"ashish-nair.webp","size":[760,2554],"portrait":[0,0,760,601],"face":[89,85,410,410]},{"slug":"ashra-c","name":"Ashra C","text":["Welcomed with her title miss tough of our batch, this cute religious girl lived upto her given post till the end, being a terror to all who have come across her (boys especially PGs, non teaching staff). She has been a revolutionary even in social networks (eventhough for a day). Very little people know that she is a light hearted person who quotes dialogues from old comedy classics and laughs herself.","The softer part of Ashra came into light only when a pediatrician stepped into her life which almost banged off her title. Still she keeps up a heart full of batch spirit which is evident from her wedding day (August 3rd) and EDC (December 16)"],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,760,560],[0,1723,760,545]],"kid":null,"sprite":"ashra-c.webp","size":[760,2268],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[174,0,342,342]},{"slug":"ashwin-k","name":"Ashwin K","text":["Innathe food kanatha vijayamayirunnu… Pakshe padam parajayam…”If you hear someone talk like this, be sure you are in the company of someone from the inner circle of Ashwin K. This man, who changed our vocabulary forever, is shy and introverted for those who do not know him. But get closer to him and you will realize that he is a source of pure joy to those around him. Coming from the northern most district of Kerala, (which he disagrees, and fervently argues that he is from Kannur), he has his roots in a strong socialist background and this may be the reason he became the soul of SFI unit in our batch.","Coming to sports, he is an exceptional athlete. He excels be it in the ground playing football or in HSQ verandah playing gully cricket. He can be a lead striker, a specialist batsman, a carroms aceyou name it. He is also blessed with a photographic memory and can recall every face he ever comes across. In spite of using this talent in a miserly manner, he still manages to be one of the best quizzers in our batch.","He is also one of the pioneers who ushered in the “Bullet”generation of CMC. Adored and loved by seniors, peers and juniors alike, this awesome guy will be remembered for the “kanatha vijayam”achieved over his friends’ hearts."],"photos":[[0,606,760,560],[0,1166,760,551],[0,1717,760,560]],"kid":[0,2277,320,320],"sprite":"ashwin-k.webp","size":[760,2597],"portrait":[0,0,760,606],"face":[270,114,381,381]},{"slug":"aswani-v-p","name":"Aswani V P","text":["Lovingly called “Thangu”, this little woman is a beautifully painted portrait of the traditional Indian woman. Being the stalworth “Nadodi” of 53rd batch, this energetic dancer has never turned us down in any interbatch’s folk dance event. A strong willed, determined lady of ultimate calmness, nothing can shake her positive attitude. She could whistle a tune and toss her hair smartly in a tease even if u put a knife to her throat.","She is described as the ‘iron woman’ to tension! Her work compliance and quickness to finish errands, make her an ‘intern-on-demand’. Surprisingly, this affection is not only from her co interns but also from senior professors. After much enquiry, it was found that her secret lay in the homely unniyappams that she distributed lavishly in certain ‘departments’. Her variety in taste makes her admire only married men, and magically, if she begins to admire an unmarried one, his marriage will be fixed within weeks.","Very frank and beauty conscious, she has an amazing talent in art and can dance oil pastels and paint in the twirl of her fingers. Though slow to anger, this adorable “Thangu” can become “Rowdy Thangam” if ever provoked. Well, unniyappams or not, this nadodi of 53rd is one on the list of adored ones."],"photos":[[0,607,702,517],[0,1124,760,558],[0,1682,760,560]],"kid":[0,2242,319,320],"sprite":"aswani-v-p.webp","size":[760,2562],"portrait":[0,0,760,607],"face":[100,12,513,513]},{"slug":"aswathi-p","name":"Aswathi P","text":["A swathi Paleri, aka ‘palerimanikyam’ of 53rd batch is a proven mixture of talents. With her typical ‘oxfordian ‘language she bags almost all the oratory prizes possible on the stage. She also proved her acting skills during interbatch and batch anniversary programs. Her ppt s have caught the eye of HODs.. emotional and delicate, she is a loving sister cum mother to her twin sisters.","Being a shop-a-holic, she can have the entire SM street (or flipkart) in her shopping cart. Undoubtedly, she was the one who heaved the biggest sigh of relief among hsa members following the salary hike. Tall, delicate and stylish-that’s Dr. Aswathi, the leader of our NRI team. Given a choice, she would have moved to germany, but what keeps her here is her dedication and attachment to CMC.","Almost all of her relatives are alumni of CMC. If she reminds you of Rima Kallingal, that’s not a coincidence. We know from Aswathi that internal beauty radiates to outside…"],"photos":[[0,591,397,343],[0,934,760,560],[0,1494,760,559],[0,2053,760,560]],"kid":null,"sprite":"aswathi-p.webp","size":[760,2613],"portrait":[0,0,739,591],"face":[100,0,591,591]},{"slug":"aswathi-p-k","name":"Aswathi P K","text":["Too few people nurture the serenity of a village in their hearts. Folks, Aswathi PK is one of them. Bold and confident on the outside, Aswathi is an innocent soul on the inside. Probably, being the parent’s pet made her an attention seeker too: risk her friendship if you don’t care for her when she is ill. Care for her during all times and she’ll be the best person you ever knew.","A fierce worshipper of women’s rights, Aswathi can talk with you for any length of time about how women do excel in all fronts of life. Two minutes of discussing medicine with her will reveal her “padippist” face. We got to see her romantic side when a radiologist asked out for her hand. Visit her home and you’ll testify that she is a great homemaker, too. Yes, Aswathi is a multitude of talents blended in one."],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,677,670],[0,1833,760,560]],"kid":[0,2393,320,320],"sprite":"aswathi-p-k.webp","size":[760,2713],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[287,44,180,180]},{"slug":"aswin-abbas","name":"Aswin Abbas","text":["The year is 2009. The venue - Saju Memorial Lecture Hall. This kid stood in front of a hostile booing audience with fire in his eyes. That speech truly announced the arrival of Aswin Abbas in CMC. Just like his unique name, he is a unique blend of a number of very different qualities. One of the most charismatic people in our batch he is an excellent orator and a good dancer. But what makes him stand out from the crowd is his leadership, ability to influence and motivate others.","Fearless and ready to speak his mind to anyone, his persona has given him admirers and haters in equal measure. Having held various posts and making each of them memorable, his last venture has been the renaissance of HSA with the coveted HSA secretary post. Interestingly, his socialist mind didn’t always approve of “unclean” places like ICH, Volga and Surettan and preferred the hygiene of Paragon, Mayflower and other high flying eateries around Calicut.","Also a believer in hardworking laborers who toil day and night, sun and rain, he is afraid of a small drizzle fearing fever, pneumonia, H1N1, Chikunguniya and whatnot. That scrawny little kid from first year has transformed into a handsome guy. Always reliable, be it for a FDFS ticket for his beloved Lalettan movie or a fight, you can always put your trust in him, sit back and relax.","Abbaska for his faithful juniors, the leader and the rebel continues to inspire us."],"photos":[[0,602,760,560],[0,1162,760,560],[0,1722,760,560]],"kid":[0,2282,320,320],"sprite":"aswin-abbas.webp","size":[760,2602],"portrait":[0,0,760,602],"face":[219,67,513,513]},{"slug":"aswin-p","name":"Aswin P","text":["You will find many self proclaimed techies in our batch. But in reality, there is just one hard core, fool prooftechie – Ashwin P. The world of information and technology and communication ticks in front of his alert eyes. Movies and tech toys are his passion. It must be some kind of divine intervention that he ended up here in the heavenly service of mankind through healing rather than following the footsteps of Steve Jobs.","Ashwin P never wanted to be a medico. In case a medico, never in Kerala. In case Kerala, never in Calicut. But fortunately for us, he got just what he wanted. He happens to be one of the most brilliant minds of our batch, and with an impetus (which has been sorely lacking for around 6 years now), he can work miracles. Calm, helpful and amicable, he only has one mortal enemy-his own deviated nose.","Given an option, he might be ready to chop it down on certain days. For any one in CMC, Ashwin P, or just P as he is known, is just minutes away for any help. With his many talents waiting to be shown to the world, P is destined to shine on."],"photos":[[0,604,600,443],[0,1047,760,560],[0,1607,760,560]],"kid":[0,2167,320,320],"sprite":"aswin-p.webp","size":[760,2487],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[175,20,533,533]},{"slug":"athira-r","name":"Athira R","text":["Owning a high IQ and lightening speed grasping power, Athira. R is yet the totem of humility. Although she entered CMC as a 10th ranker, the walls of wisdom crumpled before her as her nonstop talk and innocent blunders overran her academic excellence.’idhokke endh!’ would be her casual response to this. Yet, being the quick grasper that she is, she never thinks twice to help a slow friend; ironically when it comes to jokes and puns, Athira’s laugh is the last to start!","Eventhough her gorgeous wide smile invited a loadsome of “chori”, she was a favorite to all seniors in freshman year. For the scrupulously caring person she is, Athira is an inevitable support system to all her near and dear. Wellknown for letting herself into untieable knots with her all-time agreeable nods and welcoming hands, she is a victim to all forms of ‘chaambal’. Her favorite form of meditation being sleep, she can start at 2pm, wake up for a break at 8pm, eat and restart at 10pm!","Life is too short for a shower’ in Athira’s books, and so it happens once in 2 days; although it often surprises us that if she ever does bathe, she takes the time that two people would! Though a little person, her tiny shoulders carry the responsibility of being the mature emblem in her gang and family. And yes, if 53rd had a list of ‘10 most lovable people’, here’s one we would thread in!"],"photos":[[0,602,760,560],[0,1162,760,556],[0,1718,760,560]],"kid":[0,2278,136,137],"sprite":"athira-r.webp","size":[760,2415],"portrait":[0,0,760,602],"face":[292,62,212,212]},{"slug":"ben-xavier","name":"Ben Xavier","text":["The “Nishkalangan” of 53rd. Being educated in Qatar, Ben never imbibed the mischiefs of a normal mallu guy. A big man with a bigger heart, Ben never says no to anyone. The result being Bens car=Everyone’s car, and Bens laptop = everyone’s laptop, that is how it goes. He has grown a long way steadying his nerves being the guy who fainted after dissecting a pitched frog in physiology lab.","Ben’s singing ability is something to praise, “nenjenenje”, his masterpiece. Ben is also a big fan of the American diva Katy Perry and actress Jessica Alba. Ben lives by the motto often seen written on his tee- “life is short, make fun out of it”."],"photos":[[0,612,343,463],[0,1075,760,560],[0,1635,760,560]],"kid":[0,2195,320,320],"sprite":"ben-xavier.webp","size":[760,2515],"portrait":[0,0,760,612],"face":[205,25,362,362]},{"slug":"bijin-joseph","name":"Bijin Joseph","text":["Dr. Bijin, BAMS, MBBS The jack of all trades, once held all the powerful positions in Ayurveda College, Bijinetan has settled into CMC in a different role, still a very powerful person on the inside. Being the most experienced man in our batch, Bijinetan holds enormous wisdom in all fields be it politics, medical field and current affairs, you name it. Also a passionate traveller and a lover of music.","Bijinetan’s ability to adapt to situations and people is a real joy to watch and certainly something every one of us needs to learn, the big brother of 53rd in every sense."],"photos":[[0,601,760,551],[0,1152,760,560],[0,1712,760,562]],"kid":[0,2274,320,320],"sprite":"bijin-joseph.webp","size":[760,2594],"portrait":[0,0,760,601],"face":[263,67,190,190]},{"slug":"binsiya-p","name":"Binsiya P","text":["From the lavish ‘metropolitan city’ of “Othukungal ‘graamam’ “, Binsiya. P is stated to be the total package of innocence. She walks, talks and even eats like a child, and now she bears one too! (forgive the pun!)Even still, this girl’s super intelligence is a highlight. Although she is caught in every class for fidgeting and inattention, she never misses out on a word taught in class.","And less surprisingly, she passes every exam with nothing less than a first class. She is the forerunner to rambling non-stop nonsense and will even create scientific facts out of thin air to prove it (which will almost always be wrong and of course, nonsensical!). Her life revolves around establishing her native place to be one of the most luxurious and modernised ‘cities’ among all villages in Malappuram!","Addicted to health magazines and food facts, Binsiya is always on her toes to spread the word on it. A member of the famous 53rd’s poochamandhi team, Binsiya may be the most innocent one among them all; yet, as the saying still holds true, “birds of a feather flock together”!"],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,760,556],[0,1719,760,563]],"kid":[0,2282,320,320],"sprite":"binsiya-p.webp","size":[760,2602],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[226,178,125,125]},{"slug":"dan-faustino-kuriakose","name":"Dan Faustino Kuriakose","text":["The Man with the hottest name in the batch. Even though his name may give an image of an Italian mafia, our Dan is a simple mallu boy. Voted by girls as the Mr. Cute of 53rd, Dan is also a mama’s boy, And a planner in all sorts planning holidays and important dates beforehand and finding ways to make himself free. He also plans a lot of tours as informed by his buddies. It is often observed that Dan’s faith in God hikes up exponentially in the exam season and is frequently spotted going to church during the same period.","Childish inside, Dan still carefully possesses his first crayon pack and cricket bat. A well-mannered and a well groomed chap is what Dan is all about."],"photos":[[0,601,760,589],[0,1190,760,560],[0,1750,760,549]],"kid":[0,2299,320,320],"sprite":"dan-faustino-kuriakose.webp","size":[760,2619],"portrait":[0,0,760,601],"face":[275,14,260,260]},{"slug":"deepika-t-m","name":"Deepika T M","text":["It requires a broad heart to trust people and be loyal to them. Deepika is that rare friend who is always by you, regardless of who you are. Because of her “write fast, write neatly” policy, she can be entrusted with copy-writing entire Harrison if the photocopy machine is out of order. She only needs seconds to dress up, but hours to admire her nail polish colours. If you happened to pass through her town in 2009, you’ll realise her celebrity status on seeing the big flex boards for honoring her top rank in the entrance exam.","Well, she is the ‘kannilunni’of our batch as well as her place. She also got popularity among staff as “Dasettante mol” for her dad being the store superintendent. She is an artist, who is not that confident in her drawing. A dancer, an actress and a writer; it is hard to imagine what she is not!"],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,760,560],[0,1723,760,560]],"kid":[0,2283,320,319],"sprite":"deepika-t-m.webp","size":[760,2602],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[228,49,317,317]},{"slug":"dhyana-v","name":"Dhyana V","text":["Dhyana is too innocent for an angel. Her smile alone is sufficient to have people give her a special place in their hearts. This little lady loves to laugh out loud and embrace any new friend with an open heart. she likes a lot to talk about anything under the sun (and sometimes, things over the sun too). If some place appears gloomy, bring Dhyana in and suddenly cheer and warmth appears like a magic.","If she gets angry with you, give her a short latent period and she will be okay in no time...she is sometimes diet concious, but doesnt ever make a compromise when it comes to tasty food. Brought up as a single child, Dhyana is quite a pet to her extended family. Her inborn artistic skills are much appreciated within CMC. Her real life like pictures are a source of marvel."],"photos":[[0,601,760,477],[0,1078,760,550],[0,1628,760,455]],"kid":[0,2083,208,208],"sprite":"dhyana-v.webp","size":[760,2291],"portrait":[0,0,760,601],"face":[279,124,319,319]},{"slug":"diana-david","name":"Diana David","text":["Just as her name reminds us of royalty, our Diana is the Consultant Queen of 53rd. Being very mature and a loyal friend, she is an “advice agency” to many of her friends. Hard work is in her blood and there is no place for ‘selective study’ in Diana’s schedule. We wonder how she finished reading Bailey and Davidson amidst our killer exam series! Her perfect description of anything, be it a movie or poem, is worth a mention.","Her magical narration with its little details lets it come to life right before your very own eyes. Being a Kollam native, she has her own style of talk; if ever made fun of by her friends and her attempts to resist fail, her all-time response would be “kashtoundtto” in her Kollam slang. Else, a long “Phaa” would be the next sword to resist. Though she has no craze in shopping and fashion, nothing can avulse her from food.","Being an adipoli tube light, Diana starts laughing for a joke only after everyone else stops. And mind you, it takes her much time to stop! Genuine, caring and a perfect friend, “Self sufficiency” is an attitude and a way of life according to 53rd’s Princess Diana."],"photos":[[0,603,760,551],[0,1154,760,560],[0,1714,760,560]],"kid":null,"sprite":"diana-david.webp","size":[760,2274],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[291,25,222,222]},{"slug":"dinnu-gopal-k","name":"Dinnu Gopal K","text":["DB– Pandit Dinnu Bhai. This charming guy is indeed a pandit, his knowledge spanning many light years. One of the very few guys in the batch who can get acquainted and be friends with almost everyone, irrespective of their frequency. PDB’s charm is something to be envied of which makes him ultra-popular among the female folk. Party monster, predominantly nocturnal, online shop – a – holic and a voracious social networker, you are sure to stumble upon PDB be it Whatsapp, Facebook or any other network.","A great friend to many cool customers and an easy to go guy, PDB is one of his kind and everybody loves PDB."],"photos":[[0,601,655,474],[0,1075,748,540],[0,1615,760,566]],"kid":[0,2181,320,318],"sprite":"dinnu-gopal-k.webp","size":[760,2499],"portrait":[0,0,760,601],"face":[203,56,347,347]},{"slug":"dinsha-c","name":"Dinsha C","text":["People know her as the fairest girl with silky hair who always laughs out loud. With that pearly teeth in perfect alignment, her smile can allure even a stony heart. She is very talkative, who is aiming for a PhD in “gundadi.”A crazy shopaholic with her eyes always set on sparklig sandals, give her money and the next moment, you”ll find her with a new pair of shoes. She is a pakka ‘malayalikutty’ on the inside, who keeps her morals close to the heart.","The devil breaks loose when she is in the company of her friends, when she takes up the role of the perfect django. Her supreme facial expressions would mean that she has a future in kadhaprasangam. If you need a friend to hold your hand and walk by your side, here is the one."],"photos":[[0,604,760,560],[0,1164,760,554],[0,1718,760,560]],"kid":[0,2278,320,320],"sprite":"dinsha-c.webp","size":[760,2598],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[280,125,269,269]},{"slug":"drishya-dinesh","name":"Drishya Dinesh","text":["Drishya joining CMC was like pupa becoming a butterfly. Once a ‘nadan kutty’ unconcerned about anything but studies, 6years of CMC life brought out her colourful wings and softer side. Hailing from muzhapilangad drive in beach area, she is fondly called ‘mukkuvatthi’ for the pride she takes in describing the natural beauty of her native land. Bold and charming Drishya is curious about everything that comes in her way.","She is the kind of person who will present herself before a charging ball to experience the mechanism of action of adrenaline. While buying things, she cares most about how it can be repaired if broken, and guess what, she fixes broken things on her own, too! Drishya has the history of asking for ‘lime’ at Baskin Robbins. She is a fan of food items that carry strange names. her voice is likened to that of Rani Mukherjee and not everyone knows that she is crazy about singing.","With a broad forehead and even broader heart, our Drishya talks less and acts more..."],"photos":[[0,602,760,560],[0,1162,760,560],[0,1722,677,483]],"kid":[0,2205,262,261],"sprite":"drishya-dinesh.webp","size":[760,2466],"portrait":[0,0,760,602],"face":[300,29,250,250]},{"slug":"elga-muralidharan","name":"Elga Muralidharan","text":["The title for the best classical dancer of 53rd goes to Elga. It is doubtful if the medico community has ever seen a better dancer performing Keralanadanam. Her appearance on the cover page of CMC magazine made her an instant sensation and supermodel. She is a jovial girl ready for picnicking any time, but exams will have her jailed to her room. Mind you, her picnics are always outside of India!","If you are planning to gift her something, get her a mirror. She owns the largest mirror in CMC and is crazy about clearing the imperfections of her face every day with her branded beauty products. She acts as the ambassador and guinea pig for several cosmetic brands, but 53rdians have come to the conclusion that she is a gifted natural beauty. She is your guide if you want to learn the ABCD of online shopping.","Now you know how she manages to get brand new party wear to her doorstep!"],"photos":[[0,566,760,560],[0,1126,760,560],[0,1686,760,560]],"kid":[0,2246,320,320],"sprite":"elga-muralidharan.webp","size":[760,2566],"portrait":[0,0,713,566],"face":[19,42,516,516]},{"slug":"elizabeth-lovely-c-a","name":"Elizabeth Lovely C A","text":["Silent by nature yet powerful with her words, thats 53rd’s Elizabeth. Her writing skills have been a prize winner in many interbatch events. Although her preference to any language ‘but’ malayalam has always puzzled many (many wonder if theres a Hindi hero behind the scenes!). Her highlight being her “puccham”, even her genuine smile of greeting has baffled many professors and seniors, thus entitling her as “Puccharaani” of 53rd.","Studious, punctual and completely dedicated to anything she is entrusted with, she’s the perfect student a teacher would want. For her sincere Nivin Pauly craze, it is believed that no national award that Nivin Pauly has ever received would outbeat the achievement of earning Elizabeth’s royal fan-ship! Miss a movie? Here’s the right one to go to! Elizabeth could engrave the lines of expression on the hero’s face into your mind with her perfect narration. “The tongue is mightier than the Sword”..thats more like it for this bold girl!"],"photos":[[0,603,652,450],[0,1053,760,556],[0,1609,760,560]],"kid":[0,2169,320,320],"sprite":"elizabeth-lovely-c-a.webp","size":[760,2489],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[272,78,296,296]},{"slug":"elsa-george","name":"Elsa George","text":["Elsamma enna aankutty. if that’s what comes to your mind when you hear her name, she is sure to prove you wrong with her typical girly elegance and god fearing nature. The unique feature of this girl appreciated right from her school days is her ever-smiling face which can light up a whole room. Mastering the ping pong ball with her meter long limbs this table tennis national player formed the college TT team which won the championship for three consecutive years.","This Nadakavian not allowed to be dayski by her greedy roomies who have fell in love with her mummy’s yummy cakes and curries. A constant source of humour and leg puller to those who know her best, this girl has proved her leadership quality among the Jesus Youth community. Lucky patients of the future—you have a compassionate future awaiting you."],"photos":[[0,350,760,560],[0,910,760,558],[0,1468,760,560]],"kid":[0,2028,320,320],"sprite":"elsa-george.webp","size":[760,2348],"portrait":[0,0,442,350],"face":[89,0,350,350]},{"slug":"emil-prabha-jose","name":"Emil Prabha Jose","text":["Achaayan. The name says it all. Blessed with all the virtues of being an achaayan, this little master steals the show. We all know when Achaayan is indulging in his missions. That’s when he says “njanorumaanyanaane”. Dedicated, well organized and planned, Achaayan is one of the more mature guys you would find in the batch and you can always call upon him when in trouble. With a brilliant record in academics, Achaayan is sure to be found in the better end of rank list.","He is also known for his craze of expensive cars and gadgets and is rumored to own an AUDI (we don’t know); as they say “Achaayan knows best”."],"photos":[[0,601,722,531],[0,1132,760,533],[0,1665,622,456]],"kid":null,"sprite":"emil-prabha-jose.webp","size":[760,2121],"portrait":[0,0,760,601],"face":[244,59,431,431]},{"slug":"evelyn-m-m","name":"Evelyn M M","text":["For all of us who think that enough is enough with MBBS, Dr. Evelyn is a role model. With a bachelors in homeopathy in hand, Dr. Evelyn set out for the modern medicine saga and persisted for 6 long years with whooping scores! Evelyn, fondly known as the ‘chechi’ of 53rd, does everything according to a plan. She has a good chance of getting selected into the planning commission. Even though she is a mother and a double-graduate, she looks as if she is just out of secondary school.","It is assumed that rebellions happen in ladies hostel in search of chechi’s beauty soap, the reason for her eternal youth. 53rd loves chechi so much that they chose her to be the Ms. Personality. Her wedding was attended by buses full of CMCians. Contrary to popular assumption, Evelyn is not a bookworm:- she exactly knows what to study for the exam, shares it with friends and helps them pass too.","There is a scope for publishing books out of Evelyn’s notes. Evelyn M M is the perfection everyone is looking forward to become like."],"photos":[[0,602,668,671],[0,1273,760,560],[0,1833,643,670]],"kid":[0,2503,320,320],"sprite":"evelyn-m-m.webp","size":[760,2823],"portrait":[0,0,760,602],"face":[39,0,602,602]},{"slug":"faheema-k-k","name":"Faheema K K","text":["Emerging from spectacular Lakshadweep’s sparkling waters and lush green islands, here we present a goddess of 53rd batch. This beauty with her wide expressive eyes was royally titled ‘Ms. Eyes’ of 53rd’s. Being the only person who hasn’t visited her hometown in the very 6 years of being here, Faheema has made Calicut her 2nd home. Kind and soft hearted, she is possessive of anything thats even in the slightest contact with her.","Her sensitive nature and innocence have often given her room mates heaps of stories to tella’ fused tubelight’, because that is the ease with which this innocent girl can be fooled. Ms. Eyes is particular about her things, organised and very neat, it is believed that she doesnt like anything being moved out of place, which probably explains why she sleeps with her eyes open! Her mood phases are quite a mention.","In one phase (the tension phase), Faheema disappears, with her not even answering her phone, and would consider even printing it in the papers as ‘missing’. In the other (the happy phase), she chatters, sings and is in the highest mood of elation that she even forgets the need of bathing! We would call this “living the mood!”A room selfie maniac and deeply attached to her home every 5 minutes of a clock’s time, every emotion is evident on her pretty face.","Her fashion laws do not agree to the repetition of one dress in less than 2 years. And thus she has more clothes than any textile shop in calicut! With her picture perfect looks and captivating eyes, we cannot give nature enough credit for moulding such a beauty."],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,608,572],[0,1735,760,560]],"kid":[0,2295,219,220],"sprite":"faheema-k-k.webp","size":[760,2515],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[199,48,361,361]},{"slug":"fathima-m-m","name":"Fathima M M","text":["Even though MM looks like a very silent, totally obedient girl, she is in fact the craziest of all 53rd girls. She never keeps her mouth shut if she is in company with familiar people. She is the 53 rdian who carved her niche with her unique laziness combined with djangoism. If you want to see her, just checkout the TV hall between 11 pm and 4 am, where she’ll be entangled, excited and energetic for the whole duration watching movies and serials.","Next morning you can spot her sleeping peacefully inside lecture halls! She blames ‘thyroid’ as the culprit for her sleepiness. Even though she skips her clinical posting, never misses a single episode of her Hindi serial. She has got a quick brain and photographic memory, but she dislikes to use it until a few hours before the exam. She is truly amazing in that she can sleep till afternoon on the day before exams and gets ‘tensed’ so much that she watches two movies to relieve the stress.","She is so homesick that she prefers to be a dayscholar from Tirur, but her ‘hectic’ schedule made it practically impossible. Fathima is definitely the unrecognized django of 53rd."],"photos":[[0,614,760,560],[0,1174,760,560],[0,1734,760,566]],"kid":[0,2300,320,320],"sprite":"fathima-m-m.webp","size":[760,2620],"portrait":[0,0,760,614],"face":[131,23,408,408]},{"slug":"fathima-s-p","name":"Fathima S P","text":["Fathima is the gem of Kozhikode. Her Kozhikodan accent, “challis “and knowledge about every nook and corner of the city makes her the best person to hangout with.’Stage’ and ‘Mike’ are her weaknesses. Her ‘tholikatti’ and resistance to ‘pucham’ reminds us of hippopotamus. With her typical’ koyikkodan’ accent, she transforms every irritating bystander into calmness and discipline.","The sorrow of patients breaks her heart. Once Fathima doctor consoles them, the patient experiences bliss.”Adichupoli” is what she is living for, especially if her better half is around (their adventures is beyond the scope of this book). If you call Fathima for duty at 8, you can be rest assured that she will reach by 10. The art of being late and then getting away with it is something all CMC-ans should learn from her.","She knows best about creating an essay from a single word. You now know how she managed to get high marks in SPM. A significant bulk of answer sheets in Calicut University belongs to Fathima’s “gas”."],"photos":[[0,609,383,291],[0,900,760,560],[0,1460,760,560]],"kid":null,"sprite":"fathima-s-p.webp","size":[760,2020],"portrait":[0,0,760,609],"face":[301,145,195,195]},{"slug":"fathima-thasleema","name":"Fathima Thasleema","text":["Luckily or unlikely this Fathima is a ‘paavathan’ sandwiched between our two django Fathimas. Lovingly known as Thaslee, her response to anything begins with a sweet smile. Even though she is strong in her beliefs, she executes it out softly that is exceptionally different from other believers. She is so attached to her family that she remained a dayscholar most of the days, that too from Malappuram district.","She is a wonderful writer in Malayalam: whether it be poetry or prose. But this habit caused her a manufacturing defect in verbal form, known as ‘Achadi bhasha syndrome’. Duration of Thaslee’s sleep is independent of the sun, no matter whether it sets late or rises early. The only thing we are so curious about this girl is her hair, it remains hidden under her beautiful mafthaas, a mystery even to 53rd girls.","She studies lying down in her bed with her head up but has never being reported to be asleep during this session. Soft, gentle and humble, Thaslee is down to earth and close to heart."],"photos":[[0,625,760,560],[0,1185,760,560],[0,1745,760,567]],"kid":null,"sprite":"fathima-thasleema.webp","size":[760,2312],"portrait":[0,0,760,625],"face":[1,11,575,575]},{"slug":"gayathri-s-babu","name":"Gayathri S Babu","text":["Joined very late to 53rd batch, but she merged into 53rd in jet speed. She is the girl who constantly reminds us of the saying, ‘If you are smart, then I am the smartest’. She is emotionally strong and very bold. Her selfless attitude makes her the one whom you can rely upon. She always comes forward with a genuine solution for most complicated of problems. If you want to make her happy, just gift her the biggest of teddy bears.","Her teddy bear collection is soon to get into the Limca book for its enormity. She often handles worse situations in a reasonably good manner. She quickly draws your attention with her long straight hair which resembles the one we saw in ‘The Entangled’. She is the reowned ‘Kumbakarni’ of 53rd batch whose best pastime is sleeeping. She brings delicious food for all from home, keeping everyone eagerly waiting for her to come back after holidays.","This adventure loving dreamy and fashionable lady is too strong in decision making and in executing it. Our Gayathri is definitely a Manthra for strength."],"photos":[[0,612,760,542],[0,1154,760,560],[0,1714,760,559]],"kid":null,"sprite":"gayathri-s-babu.webp","size":[760,2273],"portrait":[0,0,760,612],"face":[361,88,190,190]},{"slug":"greeshma-p-r","name":"Greeshma P R","text":["Greeshma is one person about whom you can be best assured that you will get a sweet smile in return for your greeting. Though” greeshmam” means summer she is the”vasantham” for everyone around her. Though she owns a new generation phone, the melody that emanates out of hers is typical of old generation. Unknown to many is her multifaceted talents. She posseses wonderful craftsmanship and she is a narrator who can create visual treats with her monoplays.","She has the image of a “pavam kutty”, but the tiger breaks out if you call her “santhos panditinte naattukari”. A bucketful of coconut oil is necessary to nourish her pitch-black hair. The HSQ mess workers wring her hair to produce oil when they run out of it. if she is cross with you, anticipate an emergency and send her a lot of cute whatsapp messages as prophylaxis. Once you have done this she will forgive you of all your past cruelties."],"photos":[[0,607,760,425],[0,1032,511,670],[0,1702,760,560]],"kid":[0,2262,320,320],"sprite":"greeshma-p-r.webp","size":[760,2582],"portrait":[0,0,760,607],"face":[155,82,309,309]},{"slug":"gulam-muhammed-shafeeq-m-a","name":"Gulam Muhammed Shafeeq M A","text":["You might have often seen this guy prancing purposefully towards some unknown destination. The truth is even he doesn’t know it. He somehow, always seems to bein a state of perennial hurry. Add to that his short greeting of any person who comes in his way, you get the typical Ghulam Mohammed Shafeeq stride. He loves playing football with his friends but they will never say the same about him.","He is an infamously vicious tackler and has landed several of his dear friends in Orthopaedics casualty. However his violent streak on the pitch can be forgiven given the service he provides in terms of public transport. His Honda Amaze will be ready for take-off, be it as the ride of the bridegroom in a wedding or as the last ride in a funeral. This hardworking man has all the makings of a good doctor and he is poised to reach great heights in future."],"photos":[[0,607,760,560],[0,1167,639,450],[0,1617,760,560]],"kid":[0,2177,320,320],"sprite":"gulam-muhammed-shafeeq-m-a.webp","size":[760,2497],"portrait":[0,0,760,607],"face":[297,30,321,321]},{"slug":"habeeba-c","name":"Habeeba C","text":["A lively girl who is interested in any thing and everything under the sky. Most of her hidden talents were brought to light by the sheer act of serendipity, like her skill in dry flower arrangement. Ever since she carries dry leaves and nutshells regardless of wherever she goes. You will find that she is an Orthodox girl, but she is quite playful and outgoing. She is an avid nature lover, who prefers to be in solitude in meadows and beaches.","When she cant reach out to nature, she brings it to her room, making it a live ‘jungle book’. Her room is complete with wild flowers, animals and a full fledged aquarium! She earned the title ‘Soja rajakumari’ after she fearlessly slept during the classes of scary professors. She has travelled the entire length of Kerala to learn cooking. She has the most number of recorded experiments in cooking the staple food of Malayalis- KANJI.","Our Habeeba is therefore the Magic Oven of 53rd batch."],"photos":[[0,607,723,534],[0,1141,760,439],[0,1580,760,434]],"kid":null,"sprite":"habeeba-c.webp","size":[760,2014],"portrait":[0,0,760,607],"face":[312,96,285,285]},{"slug":"harsha-v-s","name":"Harsha V S","text":["As her name suggests, she is happy all the time except when she is involved in silly quarrels. Her quarrels are followed by a brief period of aphasia, succeeded by an explosion of apology words. To bring out the chatter box in her, put her in company of her most beloved room mates! We think that her roaring laughter (which is audible from at least a mile away) has to do with her descent from Wayanad forests.","Red colour is her weakness, though she swears that it has nothing to do with her communist background. Well, she avoids taking decisions about things other than those involving ‘red’ or ‘food’. It is fun to see her getting angry. Her friends describe her as simple and humble. Her heart melts at the thought of her loving sister. She still retains her little milk teeth and curly tresses.","And emenates charm wherever she goes. Our sweet Harsha. Straight out of kindergarten."],"photos":[[0,604,760,563],[0,1167,760,560],[0,1727,760,560]],"kid":[0,2287,320,320],"sprite":"harsha-v-s.webp","size":[760,2607],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[116,5,486,486]},{"slug":"ijas-hassan","name":"Ijas Hassan","text":["Ijas Hassan is someone who comes across as a silent, studious gentleman, but only the closest friends has got to know the child inside him. He is something of a genius when it comes to academics. But the number of immense blunders he has said over the years can easily be compiled into a book. He has a sixth sense when it comes to free food. Always omnipresent where food is served, he will be ready for his share no matter where.","Although born and brought up in Aluva, his dream girl is malabari, just for the sake of the numerous dishes that will be served for him. One of the most hardworking people, with high intellect, he is destined for greatness."],"photos":[[0,603,760,555],[0,1158,760,556],[0,1714,760,555]],"kid":null,"sprite":"ijas-hassan.webp","size":[760,2269],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[81,48,400,400]},{"slug":"indu-v-p","name":"Indu V P","text":["This Velanoor village girl is one amongst the deceptively silent ones of 53rd batch. She knows how to use silence as an answer, adores the little things of life, loves to see the world through the lens of a camera and accepts anyone just the way they are. Although indecisive on self matters, her practicality works wonders for others. She is slow to act except in matters of food and loves travelling to explore.","While 2009 presented a shy village girl who covered her face whenever photographed, CMC saw its biggest transformation as 6 years went by. When once a dupatta was like oxygen to her lungs even when in the LH mess, now we see a new generation girl with no less than western trends to flaunt and innumerous selfies. Her Formula One style of driving and ease of ‘flying’ a car at no less than 120km/hr have made her known to not just us but the traffic police too.","If you ever drop anything in her room unknowingly, worry not, it’ll be in the very same spot even if a 100 years go by, for, not a wind or a fire or even a mafia squad could make this lazy girl take the effort to pick it up. Simply to define, a silent tigress always in action."],"photos":[[0,610,760,560],[0,1170,760,585],[0,1755,639,671]],"kid":[0,2426,320,320],"sprite":"indu-v-p.webp","size":[760,2746],"portrait":[0,0,760,610],"face":[179,47,136,136]},{"slug":"ismail-m","name":"Ismail M","text":["This man is shrouded in mystery. Always keeping to himself, and in the company of his few trusted buddies, he has been an enigma. Dubbed the most hardworking person in 53rd, he sleeps less than 4 hours a day, and keeps company with books than anything else. Strong and silent, he is sincere in his work and sincere in his attitude. With the maximum number of PPs in our batch, ‘Manjeriyile Ismail doctor’ is medical college personified for his beloved patients.","With a sincere heart and will to work, he is set to have a bright future ahead of him."],"photos":[[0,604,760,560],[0,1164,760,560],[0,1724,760,560]],"kid":null,"sprite":"ismail-m.webp","size":[760,2284],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[75,17,488,488]},{"slug":"jabin-ashraf-t-p","name":"Jabin Ashraf T P","text":["Being the torch bearer of linguistic peculiarity from Malappuram, she is no less than a highly intellectual nuclear bomb! Her “Ntae Allo-ooo...” cries for anything mild to severely heart wrecking; her over the top exclamations and heartfelt smile make her a energetic package of happiness. With her above average intelligence, sincere hardwork and a planned propaganda for academics, she barely passes the exams..","Rather, she JETS through them in flying colours!! Although it was during internship that she tasted motherhood, she never gave up on her academics even then. Its believed that her child will be ‘writing’ the next edition to every medical book she has ever read because thats the sincerity she has put in to studying even during her pregnancy phase. Though loud on the outside, this girl is as soft as a feather on the inside.","She is not ashamed to shed tears for her loved ones or to offer a pat of comfort and a word of encouragement to anyone whom she sees in distress. Bold and daring, it is her casual coolness and quick responses that makes her the star that she is."],"photos":[[0,609,760,560],[0,1169,760,560],[0,1729,760,545]],"kid":[0,2274,320,319],"sprite":"jabin-ashraf-t-p.webp","size":[760,2593],"portrait":[0,0,760,609],"face":[334,65,216,216]},{"slug":"jamshad-o-p","name":"Jamshad O P","text":["On a lazy afternoon in August 2009, this short, stocky baby tells the demonic seniors gathered around, indulging in the sacred sport of ragging, ‘rag cheyyunnathokke kollam.... Pakshe body thottaal kali maarum’. The shocked seniors recovered quickly enough to give a reply which unfortunately can’t be produced here, owing to the wide family readership this book will have. This ‘Pocket Hercules’ has come a long way since that fateful noon in MH4 (though not much in terms of vertical growth which remains the same, it is compensated by achievements horizontally).","This guy pampered by his friends is known by a number of names, out of which only one - “muth” can be produced here, again due to family readership of the book. His rough exterior camouflages a butter cake like heart which melts at the sight of an ‘XX’ be it in real life or reel life. Birthday bumps is his birthright. No matter whose birthday it is, he is the one to get bashed. He bears it all with grace & in the end, with innocence overflowing, asks, “enthalle...” The ultimate PGs’ nightmare (certain MO’s too - read Thiruvangoor PHC), post graduates dread sharing a ward with our hero.","Finally, coming to the clichés, he lives up to his nick name. He is indeed a ‘muth’. With a stern look and a child’s heart, he will be loved, no matter what future holds in store."],"photos":[[0,603,760,555],[0,1158,760,556],[0,1714,760,556]],"kid":[0,2270,119,119],"sprite":"jamshad-o-p.webp","size":[760,2389],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[136,106,349,349]},{"slug":"jannath","name":"Jannath","text":["With flawless skin, long black hair and the perfect smile, here is 53rd’s ‘mermaid’ from the ‘heavenly’ islands of Lakshadweep. Beauty being her first priority, she makes it a point that she has the perfect clothes to each day she wakes up to and the simplest yet catchy adornments to match with it. If silent socialising had a ranking, this girl would be in the top ten, because thats the number of friends Jannath has.","She has friends in ever nook and corner of the college, from senior to junior batches. Everyday is a new day for her to spend with every new cousin or friend, may it be within or outside college. Although bold on the outside with her tall, well dressed looks; Jannath is a child by nature. Being on such a border of mild innocence, she is very easy to fool with a cooked up story. If she was told in the middle of the day that it was midnight and that it was only because the sun got displaced by a meteor, she would believe it!","Slow to anger, kind and ready to help any friend in need, this girl is a loyal one to her nearbies."],"photos":[[0,607,605,446],[0,1053,760,560]],"kid":[0,1613,272,272],"sprite":"jannath.webp","size":[760,1885],"portrait":[0,0,760,607],"face":[31,0,607,607]},{"slug":"jaseem-sajjad-k","name":"Jaseem Sajjad K","text":["One of the few guys who said ‘never’ to repeated calls from AIIMS, just so that he could remain in the true heaven on earth, Calicut. A born techie, he has a conjoint twin called I phone 5s. They are inseparable. He is said to be one of the few people after Larry Page and Sergey Brin, to use the android platform. His mental absorption capacity is directionaly proportional to his level of drowsiness.","Predominantly nocturnal, the more drowsy he is, more is the power of imbibition of medicine, surgery, whatever. He has always drawn comparison with his elder brothers. Already beaten by them in academics, now they stand in his way in marriage. While his batch mates are getting married left, right and center, poor Jaseem remains a bachelor. Always smiling, calm and composed, he was the one we turned to at times of crisis.","Accepting the mantle of batch rep without any hesitation what-so-ever, he did his job to perfection. Immensely responsible, with tremendous account-keeping skills, he was a model rep in every sense. He has been a tireless well oiled machine in the whole house surgeoncy. Selfless and caring, his endearing behavior made him a favorite for us all."],"photos":[[0,606,515,378],[0,984,575,670],[0,1654,760,558]],"kid":[0,2212,320,314],"sprite":"jaseem-sajjad-k.webp","size":[760,2526],"portrait":[0,0,760,606],"face":[407,147,235,235]},{"slug":"jasir-usman-k","name":"Jasir Usman K","text":["This guy has been suspected of having some distant Chinese ancestral roots since he first stepped into CMC. Most of us would remember him telling the whole batch about his ‘pakachu poya baalyam’ after seeing Coca cola and Davidson’s textbook in MH. He is hardly found in and around hostel on working days, however, he could be seen loitering around in MH exclusively during holidays.","His work with the PCU has been excellent and a lot of patients have benefitted through its services. Neat and meticulous in his ways he leads a life of order and discipline. He will be remembered by us and a huge number of patients for his many good deeds and for being a compassionate human being."],"photos":[[0,610,760,560],[0,1170,760,560],[0,1730,760,556]],"kid":[0,2286,320,320],"sprite":"jasir-usman-k.webp","size":[760,2606],"portrait":[0,0,760,610],"face":[122,58,478,478]},{"slug":"jassim-k-p","name":"Jassim K P","text":["He is opposite of a thunder bolt; you hear him five minutes before actually seeing him. Using frequencies nearing 1000Hz, his might be the maximally audible sound for human ears before actually starting to bleed through the ears. High pitched loud sounds, partying, celebrations, and laughter is what this guy is all about. His ability to befriend people - even total strangers in a matter of minutes is second to none.","On days prior to university exams, when the room is 150 degree Celsius and your brain is on fire, his presence is like water to a car radiator. Travelling and adventure is his passion. You tell him, let’s go have tea, and he will reply, “OK, let’s go to Ooty and have tea”. Versatile on stage, he has made important contributions in our dance, mime and oppana teams of our batch. Always ready to have a laugh, and always ready to lend a helping hand, you can count on him for every next celebration.","Wedding bells rang and bachelor life came to an end for him recently, but the partying streak is in full-on mode."],"photos":[[0,605,760,560],[0,1165,760,555],[0,1720,760,560]],"kid":[0,2280,320,320],"sprite":"jassim-k-p.webp","size":[760,2600],"portrait":[0,0,760,605],"face":[199,0,560,560]},{"slug":"jebin-p","name":"Jebin P","text":["A dedicated dayski who loves the boundaries of her home and cannot settle to a hostel life. Yet, of the moments she has experienced a life at college, she has enjoyed to the fullest. Jebin flipped the coin with her daring professional backstroke at kappad beach during her internship days. And yes, now 53rd has swimming to add to the list of sports we’ve specialised in! Her perfectly written surgery notes were like viral facebook pages to everyone during UG days; and even the infamous PEARLS had to throw its cover down before her notes.","Her selfie mania is of inevitable mention, not for the photos but for the comments she herself gives before anyone else.’Photogenic ‘is her description of her own self! Talk about self confidence! She is very family oriented and will give up anything to get home on time everyday. Other than swimming and photography, her hobbies include spending her stipend very sincerely without a single penny to jingle on its own within less than 4 days.","If you need to get Jebin to do something for you, bribe her with a small cute smiling child, she would risk anything to cuddle and adore little children with the same innocence she reflects. Diplomatic, ever smiling and lovable, thats Jebin. P."],"photos":[[0,602,760,455],[0,1057,760,501],[0,1558,760,554]],"kid":[0,2112,320,312],"sprite":"jebin-p.webp","size":[760,2424],"portrait":[0,0,760,602],"face":[312,148,281,281]},{"slug":"jijitha-lakshmanan","name":"Jijitha Lakshmanan","text":["Started off as ‘Ms. Cute’ and ‘Ms. Voice’ of 53rd, Jijitha never had to look back in terms of popularity. Her cute smile, innocent answers and sharp features attracted everyone starting from juniors to Professors to patients. And yes, it brought her a lot of ‘chori’ too. Although smaller than a “kadukumani”, she will put a 200% into any job you are assigning her. Better known as the hard working house surgeon, Jijitha has the unfortunate ability of attracting ‘pani’ from every nook and corner.","Making her cry is as easy as nudging on her shoulders. Now that they are sure of Jijitha shedding tears on every silly matter, friends have taken it as her default mood. Jijitha’s presence is inevitable in all college events, but she always make sure that she is on the topper’s list. For the last six years, the 1st seat in the second row of Saju Hall was earmarked for Jijitha. The best trick to irritable her is by capturing her seat.","She knows the name, address and jathakam of of every one in CMC, and hence qualifies to be a vayanokki. With Manjima, she ran ‘Jinjima marriage bureau’, a successful agency which gave a life to many seniors who were other wise single. To the recent absence of her business partner, Jijitha now runs the bureau all alone exclusively for PGs."],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,415,270]],"kid":[0,1433,320,320],"sprite":"jijitha-lakshmanan.webp","size":[760,1753],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[298,100,273,273]},{"slug":"jithin-devadas-n-k","name":"Jithin Devadas N K","text":["JD has been always too hot to handle for CMC, much expected after he rejected repeated calls from AIIMS to join them. This ultra-intelligent mind freak can devour books in a matter of seconds leaving us to think “is JD Robo?” JD’s taste in music is one big deal – from classical to death metal, JD has them all in his playlist. JD is a well known bathroom singer and he is an exceptional one.","A bit hot headed at times he cools down 100 degrees to 0 in a matter of seconds. A very dedicated friend, helpful and caring, JD is one friend you sure won’t want to miss."],"photos":[[0,617,760,560],[0,1177,760,522],[0,1699,760,433]],"kid":null,"sprite":"jithin-devadas-n-k.webp","size":[760,2132],"portrait":[0,0,760,617],"face":[169,37,361,361]},{"slug":"jithin-raj","name":"Jithin Raj","text":["Promise him a little adventure and you’ll see him join you, no questions asked. And that makes him special, our beloved Panku. He loved Sachin above cricket & couldn’t bear to watch any more of the game once his ‘God’ retired. Crazy about Bikes, Beauties & Bollywood (..& lots of other B’s to add)... A maestro when it comes to picking up songs from their opening bgm. He hates studying much like all of us but vigorously write notes during all lectures which he would never read later.","Arrogance is a virtue that comes natural to him (same with his quick temper), he can argue with anyone about anything, but always fail to hold it till last. He is an outspoken guy who can’t stand wrong doings and will voice out against, no matter what. He is more of an “act now and think later” kind of guy. You can count on him to get you out of any kind of pickle. His ‘i don’t care’ attitude (you might mistake for showoff) is indeed genuine & along with his close-enough look, makes him our Vidyut Jamal..!!"],"photos":[[0,613,760,560],[0,1173,760,560],[0,1733,760,560]],"kid":[0,2293,255,255],"sprite":"jithin-raj.webp","size":[760,2548],"portrait":[0,0,760,613],"face":[147,12,475,475]},{"slug":"juhina-p-p","name":"Juhina P P","text":["A girl in the midst of treasure house. The sole owner of Lulu gold, Juhina PP is one of the celebrities of 53rd batch. However, she lives an extremely simple life, ignoring all the luxuries she was gifted with. Sometimes she goes to a very extreme end of ‘simplicity’, which in Thalassery accent is known as ‘Perutha Pisukki/ PP’. She realises the worth of every single rupee and enjoys the fruit of hardwork.","Beware, she keeps friendship separate from her family business (What an idea sir ji!!) She is a big foodie and is fond of Arabian food. Her craving towards nuts and dates is well known. This ‘bujikkutty’ is a very straight forward, open minded, determined and lovable person in real life. The “gold”en girl of 53rd batch.... That is our Juhina."],"photos":[[0,610,557,411],[0,1021,760,563],[0,1584,704,445]],"kid":[0,2029,319,320],"sprite":"juhina-p-p.webp","size":[760,2349],"portrait":[0,0,760,610],"face":[242,67,290,290]},{"slug":"jyothis-merry","name":"Jyothis Merry","text":["Merriest person of 53rd batch, maestro of jollification. She loves outings, treats, unit trips and whatever that involves 2 or 3 of her besties. Standing tall and sturdy as her palm, this ‘Waya’nadan kiddo does not care about outward appearances, which reflects in her unpowdered face and semi-fitting attire. She has an exceptional way of making and keeping friendsonce you have made friends with her, it comes with lifelong validity.","Do not be surprised if you see her hanging out with her kindergarten friends day before her final year university. Though not a book worm she is brainy enough & has cracked some quiz competitions! On the other end of the spectrum, she is a religious woman who fights with the morning alarm to reach the nearest church. She has her own ideologies which is not subjected to changes in the surroundings and thus it gets to small arguments often.","But ultimately it is her friendship that wins!"],"photos":[[0,611,760,555],[0,1166,606,670],[0,1836,760,514]],"kid":[0,2350,320,317],"sprite":"jyothis-merry.webp","size":[760,2667],"portrait":[0,0,760,611],"face":[196,48,366,366]},{"slug":"kaleem-ahammed","name":"Kaleem Ahammed","text":["Kaleem Ahmed is a man of simple tastes, high thinking and many talents. His charming smile is a peephole to the wonderful soul within. This man’s talents know no bounds. He can direct a movie, write a poem, and design a website, anything. His cartoons often popping up in social media and wall magazines portray the brilliance of his thought process by making you laugh and think at the same time.","Just like many others, food is his weakness. In fact, sources close to him disclosed recently that while severely sick with encephalitis years back, it was chicken biryani that actually saved his life. One of the most nonviolent people in the entire batch, his mischievous smile and the sight of him waddling through the corridors, along with the innumerable cartoons that he produced, will remain in our memories for years to come."],"photos":[[0,608,630,465],[0,1073,760,560],[0,1633,760,530]],"kid":[0,2163,320,320],"sprite":"kaleem-ahammed.webp","size":[760,2483],"portrait":[0,0,760,608],"face":[197,48,364,364]},{"slug":"kavya-subramanian-m-s","name":"Kavya Subramanian M S","text":["How divinity is coupled to a Godess, so is Kavya’s voice to music. While she rules as the ‘Ganakokilam’ of 53rd, she is also a less popular, yet talented dancer, her mightiest feat being ‘He or She’, where her ‘He’ lives unforgotten. Give her a task and you will get satisfied to the core, because ‘laziness’ has no meaning in Kavya’s books. She comes with a million ideas to execute a plan but they all end up as ‘Thallippoli’.","Her memory power is that ‘sharp’ that once she spots something, she’ll never remember it ever again. Actually we are worried to write ‘pucham’ about her, as she is the one who switches into her desp mood, thanks to her sensitivity. Outings and trying new tastes are yet another of her interests. She is a master in literature, art and cooking. She is a girl next door and can make any stranger her loyal friend.","In short, a trust worthy and consoling friend who is worth keeping for lifetime.. Some songs can only be sung by certain singers and vice versaformer being true to our Kavya."],"photos":[[0,611,760,555],[0,1166,760,553],[0,1719,760,518]],"kid":[0,2237,320,319],"sprite":"kavya-subramanian-m-s.webp","size":[760,2556],"portrait":[0,0,760,611],"face":[118,25,507,507]},{"slug":"krishnasree-sasikumar","name":"Krishnasree Sasikumar","text":["53rd’s ‘Chinese-born-malayalee’. This typical Asian native with her crinked up eyes, flawless fair skin and flashy smile is one reason to make 53rd a union of a diverse cultures!. Mostly spotted in a high energy state, her extra decent look is just a superior technology of sugarcoating. Her friends are the real witnesses of her real “Tharikidaa’. With much love to her own self, she dearly calls herself “sreemol”.","Being a first chance entrée to CMC, she was and still is prudent with her assignments and exams. Being a wellknown badminton player and an great asset to the college itself for this, she never backs out for any sport, even high jump in front of professors! Flashing the logo of sincerity, be it in relationships or responsibilities, she is a loyal friend to the handful that she cherishes.","As everything has its exceptions, Krishnasree’s sincerity fails when it comes to bathing and washing clothes. Thus, of her achievements, she has tried every other person’s wardrobe and has proudly flaunted it as her own! Her classic protest to bathing is well symbolized by the chandhana kuri. Dont get mistaken! if Krishnasree is found with a chandhanakuri, it is only stronger evidence that she hasnt bathed!","Always roaming and enjoying college life, this talented dancer’s life’s priority is to get back home everyday no matter what and her phonecall frequency to her home is 3 hourly! Inspite of being a dayscholar, Krishnasree broke down the walls of a dayski’s anonymity by being the first runner up to the latest and upcoming gossips. Although she seldom enjoys expanding her gang of friends, this descendant of Chinese heritage mingles very well and is known to many."],"photos":[[0,613,760,560],[0,1173,760,561],[0,1734,760,562]],"kid":[0,2296,317,320],"sprite":"krishnasree-sasikumar.webp","size":[760,2616],"portrait":[0,0,760,613],"face":[145,9,410,410]},{"slug":"laddika-geetha-ranjani","name":"Laddika Geetha Ranjani","text":["Water is essential for life. says the second standard textbook. Geetha takes this statement for her life’s goal. Her fondness to date fruits and water makes us conclude that she reared camels during her past incarnation as the Princess of Arabia. For a Teluguvian, she knows exceptional Malayalam, and she can go as far as reading Malayalam signboards. The unfortunate custom of prefixing one’s family name worked against Geetha that she is often mistakenly called ‘Lathika’ by strangers.","When she is on long vacations to travel home, she makes sure that she has given the leaveletter, met the HOD, substituted someone and exchanged her duty, such is her passion to the work she does. Overtime, Geetha has developed a liking to boiled rice, kerala saree and Mallu accent. When she is not reading, you will find her with her soulmate, the cellphone. Salutes to Geetha, the true Malayali."],"photos":[[0,618,378,378],[0,996,760,555],[0,1551,760,559]],"kid":[0,2110,320,320],"sprite":"laddika-geetha-ranjani.webp","size":[760,2430],"portrait":[0,0,760,618],"face":[87,4,522,522]},{"slug":"liji-a-k","name":"Liji A K","text":["Size of a mustard and chatter of a cricket (for the linguistically challenged: kadukkinte valippavum, cheeveedinte ochayum) is what Liji is. Her chatter can shatter windowpanes and make professors run away. This little and smart ‘kanmani’ of 53rd can mesmerize you with her Malappuram dialect that at the end of her talk, you’ll decide to proclaim Malappuram as a separate country.","She’s a person who can eat bieiyanis 3 times a day and still live without using Dulcolax (or pantop, for that matter). Super-coolness is in her veins. A mad elephant on the loose or an emergency call from the ward cannot wake up this sleeping beauty. Blessed with all qualities of a true ‘Gemini’, Liji celebrates everything that comes in her way. One night she wishes for a chicken thandoori and on next, she’ll want a chocolate cake.","The fun is that she’ll get whatever she wants, regardless of what time of the day it is! (Thanks to ojin & biriyanihut)."],"photos":[[0,609,760,560],[0,1169,760,560],[0,1729,760,560]],"kid":null,"sprite":"liji-a-k.webp","size":[760,2289],"portrait":[0,0,760,609],"face":[352,240,138,138]},{"slug":"mahroofa-e-v","name":"Mahroofa E V","text":["If one’s tongue is a sword, Mahroofa is a warrior. She has the courage to tell any unpleasant truth to anyone, professors inclusive. She appears completely “blank” day before the exams and finishes writing the exams first well, we might guess that she won’t enter the pass list, but she will always be on the toppers list! Yes, reality about mehroofa is always surprising folks. She forgets her phone wherever she goes and later retrieves it from bushes and trees.","If you are meeting her for the first time, be sure that you have had your dose of IDRV as prophylaxis against ‘catscratches’. Her contributions to modern Malayalam poetry makes her an invaluable addition to the “poochamaanthi team.” With those thick rimmed spectacles, her intense stare can scare the cruelest PG away. The frequency of showmen is significantly lower in Mahroofa’s wing because of the spontaneous shouting and screaming.","She is surely one of her kind. An index case under evalution."],"photos":[[0,609,760,561],[0,1170,760,554],[0,1724,435,662]],"kid":[0,2386,320,320],"sprite":"mahroofa-e-v.webp","size":[760,2706],"portrait":[0,0,760,609],"face":[216,106,150,150]},{"slug":"manish-p-v","name":"Manish P V","text":["Stooping gait and staring eyes! Classic Manu Raghav, something which made him a favourite “rag-bag” for seniors. The Red devil of 53rd! First thing that comes to mind when you think of Manish is his crazy love for Manchester United and football, and he is one of those rare guys who talks football, eats football, lives football, but isn’t quite interested when it comes to playing football.","He will be like “George Bestine kurichoraksharam mindaruth!”Besides, Manish is a mini Wikipedia thanks to his extensive reading and aptitude for quizzing. Big fan of the English band Pink Floyd and David Gilmore, he is the real deal when it comes to western music. Loves to spend time in solitude and get lost in his passions. It is quite likely that the award for the most number of views in YouTube is going down to this online-aholic.","His legacy in the unbeatable EnglishDumbcharades team along with his brilliant teammates is unquestionable. Still when it comes to friends, he is always caring and genuine; passionate and faithful. That’s how we will remember this amazing personality of our batch."],"photos":[[0,611,592,670],[0,1281,760,559],[0,1840,760,428]],"kid":[0,2268,320,320],"sprite":"manish-p-v.webp","size":[760,2588],"portrait":[0,0,760,611],"face":[0,76,454,454]},{"slug":"manjima-mohan-m","name":"Manjima Mohan M","text":["It won’t take long to get to know Manjima. Talk to her for half an hour and you will be able to read her like an open book. This makes people easily fall in love with her. Living inside a shell of psedomaturity she is the biggest bondathi of our batch. Certain things she has done have ended up as comedy. With her twin sister, Jijitha, she earned the merit of being a padipist (watch her during exams and you will be surprised at her time wasting skills).","The sleeping musician in her soul had woken up only once during her lifetime for singing ‘bahara’. Despite pressure from all sides, she never tried for a second shot. This serene beauty is always the friend you will need while in need. Someone you will always cherish from college memories."],"photos":[[0,574,760,555],[0,1129,760,556],[0,1685,593,437]],"kid":null,"sprite":"manjima-mohan-m.webp","size":[760,2122],"portrait":[0,0,760,574],"face":[145,56,357,357]},{"slug":"masaud-moidu","name":"Masaud Moidu","text":["This is the story of a sheep that turned into a wolf. Once upon a time, long years ago, a tiny sheep got lost in the jungle that is CMC. He was this naadan boy from some remote Vadagara village who believed that music was bad and ghosts were real. Then some sort of big bang happened, and the Musku as we know now, came in to existence. A nocturnal being, he spends all day asleep, and comes out of his den at night.","With indulgences like jalebis and ice creams, he spends all night in the tv room, using Wikipedia to find out talking points to stand his ground in the tea time debate with friends the next day (which he miserably fails to do). This guy has the dubious record of having scored a duck in the Pharmac average exam. We can remember in silence, that poor PG who tried to find at least one sentence worth giving at least half a mark.","That said, he has always spoken out against injustice. He will always be one of the first to question a wrong doing no matter who does it. He remains a watchful protector, a silent guardian, the dark knight."],"photos":[[0,608,760,560],[0,1168,593,671],[0,1839,760,560]],"kid":[0,2399,320,318],"sprite":"masaud-moidu.webp","size":[760,2717],"portrait":[0,0,760,608],"face":[19,39,562,562]},{"slug":"merin-jacob","name":"Merin Jacob","text":["If you find a notepad with timetables lying around, you can be sure that it belongs to Merin. Though she keeps a timetable for each and everything, whether or not she adheres to it is doubtful. Her OCD for being a perfectionist (especially while reading for exams) is well known. Merin is bold on the outside, but sensitive on the inside. She knows about every cookery show and travel show appearing on TV.","Though she claims that she is an avid fan of English serials, our reporter has figured out that Merin is more enthusiastic about watching 1000episode long Hindi serials. (where she weeps with the heroine). She lives in the mortal fear of getting fatter. When she diets, she makes others eat. Her exclusive bag and chappal collection is of much envy to Jayalalitha. She is called ‘Exi-kutty’ because she exaggerates every incident she describes.","However the fun she creates in describing these incidents is simply priceless. She is a lovely sister to her siblings and a born leader to her hostelmates. She loves nightdriving as much as she loves music."],"photos":[[0,610,468,345],[0,955,760,504],[0,1459,442,326]],"kid":null,"sprite":"merin-jacob.webp","size":[760,1785],"portrait":[0,0,760,610],"face":[139,7,507,507]},{"slug":"midhun-jose","name":"Midhun Jose","text":["Aka MJ. The man who arrived in the spotlight, after launching the infamous Rocket Dance which was rocked with this mans “waves”. Despite all the glamour and style, this dude remains single, rumoured to be under the control of his sissy in 55th. It is worth noting the curious case of Midhun José. Despite the innumerable push ups and boiled eggs, this guy lost a lot of muscle mass and the pathology behind, is certainly worth a study.","Jolly, witty and shrewd, this stylish guy is one of the lesser known show stoppers of the batch."],"photos":[[0,620,760,560],[0,1180,760,559],[0,1739,760,471]],"kid":null,"sprite":"midhun-jose.webp","size":[760,2210],"portrait":[0,0,760,620],"face":[131,33,340,340]},{"slug":"minhaj-mammadu","name":"Minhaj Mammadu","text":["His heroics of singing a polappan song ended up in getting him a nick name –‘Polappan’ by which he was known thereafter. One of the most colourful guys of 53rd, Minhaj is one character you don’t want to miss. Being brought up in a business family abroad, Polappan still lives an austere life-Aamaadmi. Same goes with him being a modest man in comparison to the many freaks his family has produced.","Ardent lover of drama and movie making, who can forget the jagathi role Polappan perfected in the award winning drama. Also known for his right left confusion it is a headache if you land up in a junction with Minhaj driving you. Minhaj is also one of the best house surgeons ever to take duty in CMC; sincere and committed to work, he also has the knack of finishing jobs at ease and is a PG favourite."],"photos":[[0,610,760,555],[0,1165,760,556],[0,1721,760,552]],"kid":[0,2273,320,320],"sprite":"minhaj-mammadu.webp","size":[760,2593],"portrait":[0,0,760,610],"face":[223,58,376,376]},{"slug":"mohamed-hunais-p","name":"Mohamed Hunais P","text":["The ‘kshobhikunna yuvathvam’ of 53rd batch. He always has a definite opinion about any subject. He can fight tooth and nail to prove his point, and then shamelessly change it after 10 minutes. He gives you the first impression of a tough talking, swashbuckling maverick, but once you know him more, that image falls apart to reveal a raw man who make jokes that make you want to kill yourself; or kill him rather.","He has a curious enmity with water. Using it for luxuries like bathing every Friday, the hydrophobia gene switches on during exam season, going around one month without touching water, and it becomes ‘the survivor series’ for his friends. It is not yet clear whether this ideological difference with water has its origin in some childhood mishap, or simply he is reacting to the growing water scarcity in this world.","He believes that he can go even to the PM’s office in a lungi as long as he has his CMC ID card, he is the only person to appear for the university practical exam in hawai chappal. But as they say, looks can be deceiving. An all-rounder by all means, he excels in whatever field he graces. Ferocious debater and excellent orator, he is outspoken in social media, always ready to tell his opinion, no matter to whom.","A born leader, he has adorned the HSQ president part with aplomb and his work has been near perfection. With an Extra-terrestrial memory he had initially surprised us with a distinction in first year, but soon it became a ritual in all the exams that followed. 53rd batch would not have been the same without this man."],"photos":[[0,608,760,560],[0,1168,760,556],[0,1724,760,561]],"kid":[0,2285,320,320],"sprite":"mohamed-hunais-p.webp","size":[760,2605],"portrait":[0,0,760,608],"face":[134,22,385,385]},{"slug":"mohamed-mansoof","name":"Mohamed Mansoof","text":["Mohammed Mansoof Kanakkayil, the faithful devotee of “Apple”. His relation with i-gadgets & cars did not begin yesterday. One of the first car owners in the batch, he has never been caught in a speed cam –only because even the camera cannot catch an image so fast. His friends need not go to Veega land for an exhilarating ride – a few minutes with Mansoof in his car can satisfy your wildest adventure dreams.","He has been a loyal customer of almost all restaurants in Calicut, where he reaches without fail every day. He has also tried a hand in photography, fiercely competing with one of his best friends for the post of ‘Nishchal – still photographer of 53rd’. Mature and responsible, he has held the mantle of leadership in the HSA, and PCU. Always approachable for anyone, he will be ready to help you with excellent advice in any situation.","His innocent smile will forever remain in our hearts."],"photos":[[0,610,760,555],[0,1165,760,556],[0,1721,760,555]],"kid":[0,2276,320,320],"sprite":"mohamed-mansoof.webp","size":[760,2596],"portrait":[0,0,760,610],"face":[338,296,313,313]},{"slug":"mohamed-muhsin-k","name":"Mohamed Muhsin K","text":["A page for describing this guy is simply insulting. He is actually from a different species. He is the king of a world of his own. His life, behavior and the many quirks and qualities can be made a research subject, studied and shown as a 20 part series in NGC just like they do for Tasmanian tiger, Komodo dragon and other rare animals that roam our lands. You never need a ‘cock-a-doodle’ to know it is morning.","This guy wakes up at 5 a.m., knocks on your door and once you open he just walks two rounds in the room and without talking, goes back. Walking is his obsession. It is rumored that he started walking as soon as he was born. He eats, studies, thinks and sleeps while walking. He is the ‘Chanakyan’ of the batch. If he hears one thing, he can tell the story in 10 different ways to 20 different people in 30 different angles.","When the stories got bigger and wilder, he was honored with the title ‘pathiri’. He is ‘honesty personified’ and takes pride in the fact that he doesn’t own a toothbrush, paste, soap or anything for that matter. He can go on one of his morning rounds and return with a supermarket. Anyone with lost possessions, now you know where you should have looked for it. A child at heart, he is a river of innocence.","He likes to play football and has been an integral part of - no, not college team - batch team. And his brilliant efforts have earned us 0 honors in the last six years. He is a gem of a person. Always entertaining, ready to help, ready for anything with his friends, this man will be forever remembered."],"photos":[[0,610,760,560],[0,1170,760,556],[0,1726,760,560]],"kid":[0,2286,320,320],"sprite":"mohamed-muhsin-k.webp","size":[760,2606],"portrait":[0,0,760,610],"face":[183,118,313,313]},{"slug":"mohammed-jaleel-p","name":"Mohammed Jaleel P","text":["He is, or more aptly, was, the drug lord of CMC for years before retiring and passing on the legacy to certain loyal juniors. The story of Mohammed Jaleel, or ‘unakkamulak’ or ‘mulakjaleel’, as he is lovingly called, is entwined with the drug bank. Hundreds of patients havebenefitted from the free of cost drugs and medicines supplied from the drug bank under his leadership. He also has been the part of the PCU, again which provides food for poor patients.","A believer of the proverb ‘slow and steady wins the race’; he is usually the first person to enter the mess, and the last to leave it. But somehow he remains poorly built and malnourished which prompted the prefix ‘unakka’ to his name. Calm, pious, and gentle, he is someone who could be a role model for kids. Greater heights await him in the future."],"photos":[[0,603,359,265],[0,868,725,529],[0,1397,760,555]],"kid":[0,1952,320,320],"sprite":"mohammed-jaleel-p.webp","size":[760,2272],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[213,133,440,440]},{"slug":"mohammed-nihad-k-v","name":"Mohammed Nihad K V","text":["Two years back, people always hesitated to answer this guy’s calls. It would always be for an emergency donation of your blood! Dubbed as the angelic Dracula of our batch, he was instrumental in keeping alive the blood donation forum of CMC. He is the ultimate nightmare of sisters in wards. Fighting for the house surgeon’s rights, he often has ended up in trouble for the greater good.","He has often satisfied the appetite of his friends with delicious snacks that his mother adds to his backpack each time he returns to hostel from home. He can go to extremes in being hot headed and being ultra calm and friendly. Helpful and kind, his friendship will always be valued by us."],"photos":[[0,608,536,396],[0,1004,760,560],[0,1564,760,473]],"kid":[0,2037,320,320],"sprite":"mohammed-nihad-k-v.webp","size":[760,2357],"portrait":[0,0,760,608],"face":[241,214,283,283]},{"slug":"muhammed-nasweef-m","name":"Muhammed Nasweef M","text":["Who knew all that practice drumming on buckets over the years will culminate in bagging the first prize in inter batch and being the main drummer of the batch band!! He is the poor man’s Sivamani in the poor man’s Thaikkudam Bridge. He is also the official photographer of the batch, and can make any one look like Tom Cruise. The many talents of this man also include martial arts; he can take a hit or two, and can bamboozle you with his skills.","Being a good footballer, he was part of the legendary batch team which made us proud with the record of not winning a match in these past 6 years. He has a strange obsession with his beard; or rather, the lack of it, and is rumoured to have used everything from minoxidil to karadi thailam. Everyone knows he doesnt need to struggle for a change. Handsome as he is, he is a gem of a person.","Always helpful, genuine and caring there aren’t many like him. His drumming and his camera work will remain a highlight of 53rd."],"photos":[[0,611,717,524],[0,1135,760,560],[0,1695,760,556]],"kid":[0,2251,320,319],"sprite":"muhammed-nasweef-m.webp","size":[760,2570],"portrait":[0,0,760,611],"face":[194,66,364,364]},{"slug":"muhammed-sahir-c","name":"Muhammed Sahir C","text":["The GP king of 53rd. Mohammed Sahir is a big mystery. He can bunk postings to make his service available in different hospitals in and around Calicut and Malappuram. This service mentality has benefitted many, but rumours are that it has also troubled his colleagues in equal measure. One of the sharpest minds in 53rd, he is an excellent clinician. Soft-spoken and good looking, he had all the ingredients to be a star in the batch.","It came as a shock to many, when he got married one fine day. He is set to conquer the GP world in the immediate future."],"photos":[[0,613,760,555],[0,1168,635,671],[0,1839,760,495]],"kid":[0,2334,320,319],"sprite":"muhammed-sahir-c.webp","size":[760,2653],"portrait":[0,0,760,613],"face":[182,12,577,577]},{"slug":"muhammed-shaheen-v-k","name":"Muhammed Shaheen V K","text":["Najeneunttasarouninganjeoginyeoja.. This line may not mean much to you readers, but this should be reminding you of the iconic effort of Shaheen, better known as ‘Purgi’. It was the first time a Korean song was being sung in CMC. Ever. Even though it turned out to be an epic fail, we have to complement his guts. It’s sad that we did not get to see more of this singing sensation during the last 6 years.","He arrived here with the legacy of his brother looming over him. All seniors expected him to be as super popular as his brother. But him, with his inherently ‘pucham’ extruding face and a perennially surprised look was one of the favorites of seniors or faculty who had a little itching to relieve. All that aside, he is one of the coolest guys in our batch. He is a great badminton player as well as a part of the college volleyball team.","His many talents include bathroom singing as well as countless dubsmashes that has entertained us all. He will be remembered for every moment of enjoyment he has provided for his friends."],"photos":[[0,609,760,560],[0,1169,760,555],[0,1724,760,493]],"kid":[0,2217,320,320],"sprite":"muhammed-shaheen-v-k.webp","size":[760,2537],"portrait":[0,0,760,609],"face":[202,42,507,507]},{"slug":"muhsina-t","name":"Muhsina T","text":["She was thought of as a “mindappoocha “and “thottavadi”, but time proved us wrong. Lively and enthusiastic, Muhsina always has an opinion about everything. Persistently homesick and constantly on the lookout for packing her bags to catch the next bus to home, this innocent lady cannot be spotted in the campus during any holiday! When she’s back from home, she is all plump and chubby.","But just one day at hostel will rewind her back to her skinny and dehydrated look. She is an ardent believer who relies on God for everything. At extremepeaks of tension, Muhsina feels at ease by writing poetry and reading Malayalam novels in depth. Meet the brave lady who contemplated on Thakazhi’s novel the day before University exams! Her wild cooking experiments resulted in explosions at the kitchen and a soot stricken face, but she has not lost faith in her skills ever since.","She is a storehouse of ideas who opens her mouth only for classic dialogues."],"photos":[[0,424,671,671],[0,1095,760,560],[0,1655,760,545]],"kid":[0,2200,319,320],"sprite":"muhsina-t.webp","size":[760,2520],"portrait":[0,0,526,424],"face":[284,15,105,105]},{"slug":"najiya","name":"Najiya","text":["If cute little teddybears ever came to life, we’d proudly say that 53rd has its own. This typical kozhikodan sundari with her native slang and cute smile isnt much of the kind for words. She is known for her “late laughter” no matter how easy and clear the joke would be. This studious girl is a hardworker and is ready to put in effort no matter what to wrap up an exam schedule. Although comically referred to as “kangaroo”, she is always noted for her cute duck-like walk and shy smile.","Of the things Nocturnal Najiya doesnt know, the biggest would be “what to do during the day”. Her life begins as the sun sets and yes, we are often observing if her vampire fangs are growing out anytime! This doll is as silent as the petals in a breeze even to her nearbies and if ever put into a crowd, Najiya wears her invisibility cloak and can never be spotted to even be in existence.","With her cute doll-like walk and little-girl looks, Najiya is always one to whom you would be forced to smile to."],"photos":[[0,610,760,561],[0,1171,760,560],[0,1731,760,563]],"kid":[0,2294,319,320],"sprite":"najiya.webp","size":[760,2614],"portrait":[0,0,760,610],"face":[390,131,245,245]},{"slug":"najla-k","name":"Najla K","text":["If you start describing her brilliance, you will be at loss for words. She’s neither seen carrying big bound textbooks, nor found panicking the day before exams, but she is always on the topper’s list. Before every practical exam, people hunt for Najla’s precious colourful notes. We think that she will have a bright future as a textbook author. Always found smiling, she is not known to stay gloomy or depressed.","When she is presenting a seminar, her gaze is always fixed at infinity. It’s amazing how she gets to recall the maximum number of points and deliver a star performance! Najla’s maturity and determination will make you feel like she is your mummy. Her timely advice and help in decision making has worked wonders many a times. She is caring and loving to her many siblings and innumerable cousins: we now know why she is so homesick all the time."],"photos":[[0,603,760,563],[0,1166,760,529],[0,1695,760,560]],"kid":[0,2255,320,320],"sprite":"najla-k.webp","size":[760,2575],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[269,0,315,315]},{"slug":"najma-n","name":"Najma N","text":["jiarrived to 53rd late, as the celebrated rank holder. Over the last 6 years, she proved that she is indeed worthy of her top rank. Neji is calm and quiet, as expected of “budhijeevis”. This daddy’s kid is home sick regularly that her dad makes a humble effort to take her home and drop her back to CMC. She is the master of perfectionism, which is reflected in her way of studies and in her artistic creations.","This beauty with her long arms colored with mehendi resembles a ‘hoori’. Her dressing style and accessories are of ethnic charm. She is extremely careful and at the same time obsessive in selecting her accessories. She is the one who constantly struggles to choose between do’s and dont’s to bring out the best of everything. These days, she is so busy that she prefers to get almost everything on net shopping.","Though Neji’s world was small, her fairy tale prince gave it a new dimension. Najma is definitely the mermaid of 53rd batch."],"photos":[[0,601,760,560],[0,1161,760,550],[0,1711,760,559]],"kid":[0,2270,320,319],"sprite":"najma-n.webp","size":[760,2589],"portrait":[0,0,760,601],"face":[201,67,190,190]},{"slug":"navya-v","name":"Navya V","text":["In her past incarnation, Navya was a quizzer and writer. CMC has depleted her of these skills, but has made her a talented clinician. “One case taken a day, keeps Navya at bay” goes the modern proverb. She has the unique record of having taken a case during Dentistry posting. Her malnourished look, in contrast to her chubby sister, makes us think that Navya is being starved by her sister.","It is probably Navya who discovered that the art of calligraphy is not alien to doctors. Navya’s long, neatly oiled dark hair is a source of envy to batchmates. Please do not mistake her watery eyes for her mood, because Navya’s hypertrophied lacrimals can shed tears anytime even when she is laughing. According to Indian mythology, the waters in Feroke puzha originated from Navya’s tears. 8:00:00 is her reporting time at the ward.","Relieving time depends on how much work is being entrusted upon her. Navya is a relief to unitmates because she always has a fresh case in presentable form ready in her case diary."],"photos":[[0,609,760,563],[0,1172,760,560],[0,1732,760,495]],"kid":[0,2227,320,320],"sprite":"navya-v.webp","size":[760,2547],"portrait":[0,0,760,609],"face":[154,0,573,573]},{"slug":"neethu-k","name":"Neethu K","text":["Miss bath of 53rd -a title that cant belong to anyone else goes to our own Neethu. She is a real smart leader who is willing to take up any responsibility. She will even shoulder the earth if that is needed for 53rd! Once a daring politician, she was the female pillar of the white fort, but these days she is in hibernation, the mystery of which still remains. This beauty has got numerous bachelors drooling at her persona, PGs and batchmates inclusive.","On the first look, she will give you the impression of ‘shaleenasundari’, but she has given exemplary performance in ‘udayipp’. She is your partner in all matters related to promoting ‘brand 53rd’ in CMC. Neethu hails from kannur, the land so famous for its hospitality and warmth, no wonder why helpfulness is in her blood. She is a blessed singer who can sing ‘thaarapadham chethoharam’ far better than the original singer.","Unfortunately, CMCians did not get a second chance to admire her sweet voice after 1st year. For 53rdians “Neethu” is an unforgettable name. More so, if its suffixed with “k” as initials..."],"photos":[[0,601,760,557],[0,1158,760,555],[0,1713,752,549]],"kid":[0,2262,160,163],"sprite":"neethu-k.webp","size":[760,2425],"portrait":[0,0,760,601],"face":[370,99,252,252]},{"slug":"neethu-n-t","name":"Neethu N T","text":["Neethu is lovingly called ‘NT’ by batchmates. Her house on the roadside was a landmark for CMC-ians until she moved to another place last year. If her house is being painted or gate is being replaced, the entire batch would know. Her crazy ideas include wearing a ‘lucky churidar’ for all exams. Obsessive about studies, Neethu makes doubly sure that she has seen all slides atleast a 100 times before the exams.","She knows that perseverance is the key to success. Her main hobby is picking up a silly quarrel with her best friend on one day & reconciling with her in the next. Whether it be ordering for extra masala with CB in ICH or asking for an ST ticket in the local bus, Neethu best knows how to be economical to the last penny. Neethu’s charm and soft-heartedness attracts everyone, PGs inclusive.","This brown eyedbeauty had a syncope during her 1st casualty visit, but overtime she became a responsible house surgeon who managed emergencies single handedly."],"photos":[[0,498,760,560],[0,1058,678,670],[0,1728,760,562]],"kid":[0,2290,320,320],"sprite":"neethu-n-t.webp","size":[760,2610],"portrait":[0,0,621,498],"face":[73,0,498,498]},{"slug":"neethu-p-m","name":"Neethu P M","text":["Although she came to CMC as a meek girl and grew up as a responsible young lady, Neethu underwent a makeover during 6 years in CMC. Though she is the topper in all exams, Neethu is always found in the corridors of the departments, learning and re-learning her notes. Thus she gets miles ahead of other toppers every single time. She has an insanitable appetite for knowledge, so she goes to any extent to acquire notes and ask questions.","It is impossible to be fairer than Neethu. Her good looks made her a target for ragging by seniors. Any visual learning materials (bones, slides, instruments)catches her attention her so much that she keeps returning to view them again and again. Some people thought that the duty PG in ophthalmology is her clone, but they later realized that she is Neethu’s sister. Not a foodie, but she is mostly found eating out.","Neethu. P. M. is a person always working to perfection."],"photos":[[0,611,760,560],[0,1171,760,560],[0,1731,760,560]],"kid":[0,2291,320,320],"sprite":"neethu-p-m.webp","size":[760,2611],"portrait":[0,0,760,611],"face":[167,37,378,378]},{"slug":"neethu-s","name":"Neethu S","text":["hewas the College Union Joint Secretary during 2013-14, always exploding with a brook of words on interbatch oratory stages. Enter her room and you will find thousands of books scattered all around. No wonder why she looks like Cindrella who just walked out of a fairy tale book. She is also a size zero, bollywood actresses stand a mile away from her when it comes to being the perfect shape.","“Multi tasking maniac” - don’t get carried away - she excels in anything and everything as long as she has a mobile in her hand. She is a frequent visitor to all CMC’S Departments (except, ofcourse, Pediatrics) for finding a cure for her strange ailments. She has ever since remained a challenging specimen to most doctors. She is known to believe everyone blindly and help them heartily.","She has a solution for the toughest of problems. Thank you Neethu, for being the extra ordinary person you are.."],"photos":[[0,609,760,560],[0,1169,760,481],[0,1650,760,433]],"kid":[0,2083,219,219],"sprite":"neethu-s.webp","size":[760,2302],"portrait":[0,0,760,609],"face":[242,123,305,305]},{"slug":"neethu-santhosh","name":"Neethu Santhosh","text":["Early to clinics and punctual to exams makes a girl healthy wealthy and wise, goes the proverb. This is so true for neethu, who was always entrusted with the responsibility of opening the lecture hall every morning. Though she is a super model, singer and dancer she has always preferred to stay away from the lime light. Her long hair has earned several fans among her batch mates and even seniors.","Though her hand writing is legible, it is barely comprehended by humans. How she manages to earn good marks in exams is still a mystery. It is incredibly hard to survive in a batch of five neethus with just the first name, so some people chose to refer her by her surname. This is how she became the joy (santhosham) of 53rd batch. Whether it be her running fast to catch her evenimg bus or to get home or be it dressing up in a saree for a function, Neethu does it in style and elegance.","Very few people know that she broke her teeth braces while munching a “parippu vada”. Keep spreading joy, Neethu!!"],"photos":[[0,618,760,443],[0,1061,760,556],[0,1617,760,494]],"kid":[0,2111,320,318],"sprite":"neethu-santhosh.webp","size":[760,2429],"portrait":[0,0,760,618],"face":[143,6,494,494]},{"slug":"nesva-p-hamza","name":"Nesva P Hamza","text":["If innocence is a virtue, Nesva is an angel. She appreciates every little thing in life (such as the sight of a thermometer or the feeling of evaporating handwash). She doesn’t give a damn about anything at all, as long as it doesn’t affect her in the immediate future. That is why she always waits until the last date to start doing any task. It is near impossible for her to read for exams without a combi-partner.","Rumors are that she got deported to gulf during house surgeoncy. But we now know that she had flown to Manipur to meet her sweetheart. She is one of the rare people in our batch, who has many homes to go to on any holiday. Therefore, she decides her destination only after reaching “Puthiya stand”. Once a loner, she started her travel adventures after finding her better half. Let us all thank the paediatrician for changing her the way to what she is now."],"photos":[[0,609,690,671],[0,1280,760,556],[0,1836,760,563]],"kid":[0,2399,320,320],"sprite":"nesva-p-hamza.webp","size":[760,2719],"portrait":[0,0,760,609],"face":[307,140,231,231]},{"slug":"netha-hussain","name":"Netha Hussain","text":["Netha Hussain is an international figure with a local outlook. She is seen in Europe one day and in the medicine ward on the next day. She sleeps during every afternoon class and blames it on the jetlag. Her crossed-v dupatta, round earring and the large put-up clip makes her the best specimen to represent the fashion of the 80’s. During first year, she was the teacher’s pet who always sat in the first bench of Saju Hall.","Overtime, she started moving backward, one row at a time. Her excuse for not attending any college events is that she has a lot of work on Wikipedia. But she is always at the forefront in terms of batch spirit for quizzes and writing contests. She has probably presented more topics in international conferences than in classrooms. Her love for polyester churidars and paani-poori is well known.","She is obsessed about going home every day, probably to sing lullabies to her cat. For all your tech-related doubts, she is the best person to approach. If you want to know more about her, ask Google."],"photos":[[0,603,727,534],[0,1137,760,560]],"kid":[0,1697,220,221],"sprite":"netha-hussain.webp","size":[760,1918],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[229,81,212,212]},{"slug":"nikhil-m-k","name":"Nikhil M K","text":["Nikhil, or as we know him, ‘kannapan’, the lovable rascal of our batch. A man of few needs, no one seems to know where the 20K he gets from the Government of Kerala evaporates to, every month. Ever calculating when it comes to shopping, he spends hours in Amazon or Flipkart, torn between what to buy and what not to. But always, the final decision is same - a much cheaper replica from SM street.","There won’t be a man in our batch (maybe even juniors, seniors, pgs and? faculty) to whom this guy doesn’t owe financially.. Always ready with the perfect story which conveys his helplessness, the ever smiling kannappan can convince the lender how much better it is to keep their cash with him. Orthopedics is supposed to be one of the most hectic postings in house surgeoncy. This guy holds the record for most hours slept by a house surgeon; and it was duly achieved in orthopedics.","Kudos to his brilliant efforts!! He has also provided a two wheeled public transport (BLACK Yamaha FZ) for the ones too tired to walk after intensive learning in lectures and wards. A great singer, he can add life, be it on stage, or in the hostel room with his friends. Always cracking us up with funny one-liners and anecdotes, his presence is what you actually need when life gives you lemons."],"photos":[[0,606,760,560],[0,1166,760,560],[0,1726,760,561]],"kid":[0,2287,320,320],"sprite":"nikhil-m-k.webp","size":[760,2607],"portrait":[0,0,760,606],"face":[165,16,393,393]},{"slug":"nikitha-k-ahamed","name":"Nikitha K Ahamed","text":["For her lovely smile and pleasing conversation, Nikitha always stands out of the crowd. Her character is as beautiful as the uncut diamond she wears. Her sense of fashion in choosing salwars with beautiful veils was emulated by the entire batch and juniors alike. She is a frequent traveler from Tirur in the ladies compartment and an avid lover of tastes. 53rd has witnessed a bloody battle to decide her roommate, because she brings delicious food items for her roomies (which she claims as self-made) every time she returns from home.","Be it happiness or sadness, every emotion reflects on her face. She is the perfect addition to your gang, if you are going out for a movie or a dinner. Nikki lights up the place with charm and fun, be it her home or hostel room. Her neatly written clinical notes is a source of envy to many. Nikki will lend you a shoulder to lean on and ideas to rely on."],"photos":[[0,606,760,560],[0,1166,614,442],[0,1608,760,562]],"kid":[0,2170,320,320],"sprite":"nikitha-k-ahamed.webp","size":[760,2490],"portrait":[0,0,760,606],"face":[205,20,416,416]},{"slug":"nikitha-n-k","name":"Nikitha N K","text":["Born in a family full of doctors, Nikitha has atleast one relative in all of CMC’s departments. The scary thing about it is that every faculty knows her, and they take it as their birthright to know Nikitha’s score in all exams. Nikitha’s slow motion walk is best suited for the ramp but she shies away from stage performances. Her mobile phone is a store house of selfies from all possible angles.","Her wide eyes and charming smile will attract anyone, but the only time she got attracted to someone was while suturing the episiotomy wound in labour room. Rest of the story is “his”- story, people! She swears that she will not migrate to AIIMS following her family’s footsteps, but you can’t quite be sure of it yet. Slow and steady wins the race, they say. So true for Nikitha."],"photos":[[0,605,760,561],[0,1166,760,560],[0,1726,760,564]],"kid":[0,2290,320,320],"sprite":"nikitha-n-k.webp","size":[760,2610],"portrait":[0,0,760,605],"face":[414,129,167,167]},{"slug":"nimisha-p-v","name":"Nimisha P V","text":["A girl with an attitude as sharp as a dagger, sparks of ideas, wide views and a confidence to face anything under the sky. She is the axis of 53rd dance programs from choreography to costume selection to stage performances. CMC has not seen another flawless syncro with such graceful flow of movements as in 2012. Her masterpiece perfection is seen not just in dance but even in her very own designerwear amazingly created from 10 ordinary clothpieces.","Though Nimisha is a remote village girl, the brands she uses mirrors those used by Bollywood’s glamgirls; because if theres one thing that bothers her...its looks, looks and looks! (“simple make up” as in the movie’1983’!!) It is well known that any junior who has had an encounter with this P. V.(psoriasis vulgaris) never would dare to cross her path again; thanks to this ability, her place as a faculty in OBG’s lineage has already come to be!","She proudly earned the title of ‘Miss batch’ by ‘missing’ her 7 mobiles, 4 ATM cards, 10 pen drives and even university marklists! Stamping the word ‘Ouch’ to CMC’s dictionary; she is famous for her littering of English. This master cook demands unhealthy food only and hibernates very often into her dreamworld. Although short tempered, dominating and assertive; she is a helping hand to many juniors and friends.","Nimisha to CMC is like gagnam style to music, Whoa!"],"photos":[[0,604,760,560],[0,1164,652,672],[0,1836,655,671]],"kid":[0,2507,320,320],"sprite":"nimisha-p-v.webp","size":[760,2827],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[321,166,269,269]},{"slug":"nimisha-t","name":"Nimisha T","text":["Known as “walking world bank”, she lends money to anyone and everyone on road. The best thing about her is her excellence in decision making on matters big and small. Of late, she has specialized in settling silly quarrels and making everyone laugh at the end. Also, the “pucham” on her face is the first response to anything! “Cinema, food and travel” were her idea of fun for the past five years.","Enjoying every moment of life is her motto. Even though she gets involved in everything except studies, her marks are extraordinarily high (so high that it hits the ceiling!) Critics says that her puffy face happened as a result of contracting nephritic syndrome during childhood but reality is that it happened so because of the pampering of her sweetheart. This moon face makes her so cute that her little eyes close when she is smiles.","Lovably adorable, thats our Nimisha."],"photos":[[0,607,760,560],[0,1167,760,427],[0,1594,760,434]],"kid":[0,2028,320,320],"sprite":"nimisha-t.webp","size":[760,2348],"portrait":[0,0,760,607],"face":[113,64,402,402]},{"slug":"nithin-p","name":"Nithin P","text":["No one remembers his real name. He was, is and will always be ‘Aashan’. Literally the aashan of everything, this man is a rare phenomenon. He comes across strong and silent, but in reality, he is a silent killer. Once you pass the initial barrier of silence with which Aashan presents himself, you will find yourself in a wonderland or better an aashanland where anything is possible.","The first intrabatch love story was craftfully scripted, directed and acted out by Aashan. He also has this record of having presented a case for the first time at the final university practical, and passed out in flying colors. He has a passion for good movies (though dubiously, he remains a Dileep fan), and loves to hum a song when in the mood with his friends. This man is one hell of a friend to have.","When the world is against you, you can be sure you will have Aashan by your side. Calm, caring and immeasurably helpful, Aashan remains the friend of a lifetime."],"photos":[[0,605,760,484],[0,1089,760,560],[0,1649,760,555]],"kid":[0,2204,320,319],"sprite":"nithin-p.webp","size":[760,2523],"portrait":[0,0,760,605],"face":[111,44,307,307]},{"slug":"nithyabhai-t","name":"Nithyabhai T","text":["A paavam girl with long hair. This is the impression Nithya has amongst the rest of the batch. But a very few have seen her jovial true self. She never fails to come up with punch dialogues, be it during an otherwise boring treat or in a crazy second stage labour room. She can maintain a poker face during any situation, keeping you guessing what is going on inside her head. Her resemblance to her bestie Navya is so strong that people were bedazzled at her ability of travelling fast between two places!","She is one of the most consistent performers in our batch. Her ability to juggle numerous PPs from her native place is phenomenal. Statistics say that Perambra has the maximum number of patients attending CMC, thanks to Nithya. On hearing her name, many people doubted if she belongs to a royal family, so Nithya chose to prove it true by living a royal life, by being the uncrowned princess of Perambra.","Unbeatable Nithya. Coolness and punctuality blended in one."],"photos":[[0,605,760,560],[0,1165,760,560],[0,1725,760,560]],"kid":[0,2285,320,320],"sprite":"nithyabhai-t.webp","size":[760,2605],"portrait":[0,0,760,605],"face":[97,11,516,516]},{"slug":"nuwais-p-e","name":"Nuwais P E","text":["When Nuwais called himself Dulquar Salman, 53rd batch called him “maanjaalan”. A truly innocent guy from Kondotty, Nuwais is a born entertainer. Who cannot get a belly ache when this guy is on stage! Be it skit or dance, he imparts a special energy and enthusiasm to any programme he participates, even his presence in the crowd makes the crowd boisterous. Nuwais is also a “who-cares” kind of guy, we still remember the Nuwais who munched a pazhampori in and walked through the college veranda in a white coat.","He has an unusual enthusiasm for case presentations, but often, they turn out to be a disastrous comedy show. Nuwais is also a diehard fan of Argentina football team and Messi, never misses a game and specifically scouts Argentine players in club games, much like the national coach. It’s sure that this guy has prolonged the life span of most 53rdians through his innocent humor and that’s how we shall remember this lively funny guy."],"photos":[[0,606,760,560],[0,1166,760,560],[0,1726,760,555]],"kid":[0,2281,319,320],"sprite":"nuwais-p-e.webp","size":[760,2601],"portrait":[0,0,760,606],"face":[151,73,349,349]},{"slug":"prathyusha-v-k","name":"Prathyusha V K","text":["“Aaj Pinky ka birthday hein” is the most clinched dialogue in Hindi serials. But for CMC’s own ‘Pinky’, every day is celebrated as, if it is her birthday with chocolates, cakes, and ice creams. She is the backbone behind every stage show of 53rd, especially those involving dance. She will walk to the end of the world to make sure that her work is perfect. If you open your ears for Pinky’s criticism, you’ll have to shut it close at some point because she will have enough material to criticize you forever!","But if it comes to her own work, she is ready for any compromise! Though she owns a PhD in churidar designing, she is so humble that she will hug you tight while watching horror films. For all Hritik Roshanmovies, Pinky’s viewership was responsible for the box office successes. To achieve her lifetime goal of shedding a few pounds, she has tried out dance, yoga, aerobics, dieting and even swimming.","This ‘lovable’ girl cannot bear to see anyone hurt, may it be in real life or in the virtual world of romantics in movies. She is the first to comfort her friends whatever may be the circumstance emotional or even financial."],"photos":[[0,611,760,560],[0,1171,760,542],[0,1713,760,546]],"kid":[0,2259,320,320],"sprite":"prathyusha-v-k.webp","size":[760,2579],"portrait":[0,0,760,611],"face":[163,39,228,228]},{"slug":"priyesh-sankar-k","name":"Priyesh Sankar K","text":["What happens when someone is cute, handsome and apparently innocent with a unique sense of humor? He becomes Priyesh, the chullan Prichu we all know and love, for the most part. But there is more to him than meets the eye, and the world still hasn’t figured it out all. He believes in his comic strengths, sometimes churning out instant classics. At other times, he is at the receiving end of a badly timed pun.","He has a soft spot for branded items and procures the latest smart device, making his net-worth a lot more than the visual scale. To sum it up, it goes something like this..”Prichu oru sadharanana manushyanalla”."],"photos":[[0,606,760,556],[0,1162,554,664],[0,1826,471,348]],"kid":[0,2174,320,320],"sprite":"priyesh-sankar-k.webp","size":[760,2494],"portrait":[0,0,760,606],"face":[121,41,465,465]},{"slug":"rabia-kawser-k-p","name":"Rabia Kawser K P","text":["Whatever it be, bunking classes or playing pranks or studying in groups, Rabia would always be there in the forefront. If left alone, she is a loner, but she forgets about the rest of the world in the presence of her gang of friends. For her childish behavior and immaturity at times, she got the nick name ZERO-P (P for ‘pakwatha’)Her skills in scaring juniors is well known. She went to the extent of offering ‘chori’ to a 52nd chettan thinking that he was a junior.","Only a few of her friends know that she is fragile at heart. Her tensions are about ‘big’ things like, “How to behave with others at a wedding party?”, “which dress to wear for the evening? “, “will I miss the TV program?”. The mystery behind how Rabia keeps the perfect figure despite eating a lot of food needs to be cracked. All hail the fair beauty, Rabia."],"photos":[[0,603,760,561],[0,1164,760,561],[0,1725,760,557]],"kid":[0,2282,320,320],"sprite":"rabia-kawser-k-p.webp","size":[760,2602],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[359,77,186,186]},{"slug":"raeesa-k-k","name":"Raeesa K K","text":["Approach her with a problem she will give you a solution. She plans in a advance, works with consistency and finally wins what she wants. She loves to do everything on her own and takes pride in doing so. She has great memory, especially in remembering dates and events. Wedding news never fails to escape her radar. She is the proud owner of a vast collection of wedding photos of 53rd brides.","She has so many friends that she gets to attend one marriage a week. Walk into her room and you will find a museum of memoirs. Rare collections include the mini umbrella over the juice glass sipped by her sweetheart. She stores food items until they reach the expiry date or get stolen by her roomies. If you talk with her for an hour, almost half I the time will be spent talking about her better half.","Though she is a responsible house surgeon, she gets angry if any PG questions her integrity. How she manages to stay fresh every morning after hours of chatting over the phone during night still remains a curious mystery. Strong willed Raeesa -Today in Kozhikode. Tomorrow in London."],"photos":[[0,604,711,523],[0,1127,760,504],[0,1631,760,562]],"kid":[0,2193,320,320],"sprite":"raeesa-k-k.webp","size":[760,2513],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[199,149,228,228]},{"slug":"rajitha-e","name":"Rajitha E","text":["Rajitha is the index case where innocence and sensitiveness cross paths. Silence is not her cup of tea. Her answers are most often funny, if not innocent. You can’t get answers to questions like “Which continent is Paris in?”, but you will surely find answers to real life problems from Rajitha. At times, she is in her dreamy world, but she handles reality with ease, too. Rajitha has a knack in mixing and matching her wardrobe.","You’ll think that this girl is wearing a new outfit every other day, but she is actually working out a ‘mix & match’. The surprising fact is that every dress she wears is ‘skinny perfect’ for her. Rajitha is still cross with her parents for not naming her ‘sneha’. True to this, she knows how to love others without expecting anything in return. It is very easy to play tricks on her, so her friends have made it a habit to scratch her for fun 24×7.","However, Rajitha ‘the innocent girl’ fails to realise that she has been scratched! The lolakkutty of 53rd. Bubbly girl Rajitha."],"photos":[[0,609,760,565],[0,1174,760,563],[0,1737,760,556]],"kid":[0,2293,106,106],"sprite":"rajitha-e.webp","size":[760,2399],"portrait":[0,0,760,609],"face":[287,168,286,286]},{"slug":"ramsiya-e-v","name":"Ramsiya E V","text":["A kitten on the outside and a fierce tigress on the inside. That is Ramsiya. Beginning her saga in Mr&Ms SP during first year, Ramsiya enacted every role that came her way (and now the real life role of a mummy too!) Talk with Ramsiya the day before exams and you will be dumbfounded by her encyclopedic knowledge. This is why sensitive people refuse to talk to her before exams or stab themselves to death for the fear of losing confidence.","If you don’t find her in hostel, she is probably pillion riding on her sweetheart’s bike. Her foot-length salwars were in the top fashion magazines for years together. Consistent with studies and punctuality for classes, this chubby lady made sure that she learnt much more than what is required for exams. Nowadays the tigress is busy rearing her cute cub, it seems. Lets hope that this ferocious tigress will be back to action and shake CMC soon!"],"photos":[[0,611,353,259],[0,870,760,560],[0,1430,760,560]],"kid":[0,1990,320,317],"sprite":"ramsiya-e-v.webp","size":[760,2307],"portrait":[0,0,760,611],"face":[140,0,611,611]},{"slug":"reeza-azeez","name":"Reeza Azeez","text":["One among the ‘transferred-ins’ who joined our batch weeks later and was always anxious about coping up. Reeza is known among her unitmates as the one who spontaneously laughs without thinking and later recollects it to laugh again (we promise you, she isn’t crazy! we did observe her for a while!). Closely accompanied at most times by her closest friend Rima Lakshmi, Reeza is known for her kind smile and formal greetings of ‘Good mornings’ and ‘good afternoons’.","Sincere in work, hard worker in academics, family attached and patient in friendship, Reeza is bold to answer and even bolder to admit what she doesn’t know. Her clarity of speech and ease of vocabulary has always put her succeeding roll numbers into trouble for every viva (Yes! they are still tailing her for revenge!). Reeza would heartfeltly commit to others, though her affection and attachment to home keeps her away from socializing enough.","We would say it has always been a blessing, because for a fact, what’s a group without the homely lovable one who understands and comforts. If sweetness was designed to lie in one’s voice and technique of responding, we present to you, Dr. Reeza Azeez."],"photos":[[0,293,633,466],[0,759,760,490]],"kid":[0,1249,317,320],"sprite":"reeza-azeez.webp","size":[760,1569],"portrait":[0,0,367,293],"face":[133,23,96,96]},{"slug":"reshma-ahamed-c","name":"Reshma Ahamed C","text":["‘Njan pidicha muyalinu 3 komb’ is the attitude of this’ poochamandi’ girl. She can even stand alone and fight with the rest of poochamandis to prove her side. Its rumoured that Reshma often quarrels with all around her, even PGs, staff and friends being no exceptions. But truly speaking, it is because of her over-dedication. She is a deadly combination of boldness and maturity that makes this poochamandi girl stand independent.","Unlike her friends, she thinks before taking decisions. But once decided, her attitude is “Let the world change I‘ll be like this only”. She is often confused in the context of Emotions v/s Intelligence, because emotions always overrule her intelligence. Her high pitched catchy voice can make anyone surrender to her. She is a very supportive and caring person inside and a generous doctor to patients.","Here we present a girl as strong as a diamond, our Reshma."],"photos":[[0,609,760,559],[0,1168,760,560],[0,1728,760,560]],"kid":[0,2288,320,320],"sprite":"reshma-ahamed-c.webp","size":[760,2608],"portrait":[0,0,760,609],"face":[427,27,235,235]},{"slug":"rima-lakshmi","name":"Rima Lakshmi","text":["You may think that silence is her mother tongue, but get to know her rightly..and you’ll wish she had a pause button! Rima is the example to “flight of ideas”. If at one moment she talks about her cute fights with her sister, the next second it’ll be about the signs if cardiac failure! For Rimalakshmi, life is a battle. If anxious eyebrows were an adornment, our Rima would have a chest full of them, for thats the sort of tension she bears.","Her repetitive murmurs of short notes and essays, not to mention “ayyo enik pediyaavunnu!” is like an exam mantra for us before entering the exam hall. Where tension is one part of life for Rima, hardwork is the other. For the persistent hardwork and effort she puts in, it is never surprising as to how she bears the burden of good scores. Although she may seem like a less colourful story in college to many, on the inside, Rima is a yearner for colours.","Hath there be an occasion, this silent doll prefers bright colours in lovely patterns and carries herself very well. As a friend, she is a comforter and a support system to her nearbies and will never give up on them no matter what. After all, silence when used rightly is the best medicine to anything. Thats our Rima!"],"photos":[[0,611,760,432],[0,1043,760,560],[0,1603,640,540]],"kid":[0,2143,320,320],"sprite":"rima-lakshmi.webp","size":[760,2463],"portrait":[0,0,760,611],"face":[249,19,224,224]},{"slug":"roshni-b","name":"Roshni B","text":["Exemplifying the popular saying “Looks Are Deceptive”, this girl can soothe you with a smile and steer your verbal output with minimum words. She may be small and cute, but quite the nuclear weapon on the inside. Known for her genuine kindness and sincerity when it comes to work, she reflects the same in bonds of friendship. A talented dancer with quite the skill at craftswork, Roshni is the keeper of every academically -oriented gang.","She has a colourful collection of ‘paavadas’ and she wears them quite often, much to the envy of her hostel mates. She surprises the batch once in a while by topping the exams. Methodical and consistent are the two words that describes her nature Her co-house surgeons believe that she is the most comfortable person to work with. One pair of earrings a day is her style. She owns a collection of ear hangings too.","Quite a large package in just 153 cms, eh?"],"photos":[[0,611,760,559],[0,1170,760,560],[0,1730,639,471]],"kid":[0,2201,320,320],"sprite":"roshni-b.webp","size":[760,2521],"portrait":[0,0,760,611],"face":[176,61,218,218]},{"slug":"rubeena-bava-k-h","name":"Rubeena Bava K H","text":["“Arabikkathayile sundari”. Though Rubi appears like an innocent beauty, she is naughty and funny to those who know her closer. Though she is simple by nature, once she dresses up, she looks like Mumtaz Beegum. With her keen observation power and sharp memory, she can reconstruct any page in Davidson within the flick of a second. She also notices subtle details about people and presents them in a way that can make the audience laugh till their stomachs hurt.","Birthday cards designed by her are the lovliest gifts you can get. If 53rdians need mehandi, then Rubi is sought for. She did not smile widely for fear that people may notice her ‘randaam pallu’ until Samvritha Sunil became a sensation. She loves kids and knows how to handle them. Mayavi & Superman are still her superheroes. Despite being sugar coated on the outside, she is ‘salt and pepper’ on the inside."],"photos":[[0,601,643,640],[0,1241,760,560],[0,1801,760,562]],"kid":[0,2363,320,320],"sprite":"rubeena-bava-k-h.webp","size":[760,2683],"portrait":[0,0,760,601],"face":[209,77,237,237]},{"slug":"ruksana-p-m","name":"Ruksana P M","text":["Even if the wind whispers, our lovable ‘Ruku’ wouldn’t because silence is her birthright. Soft on the inside and generously kind on the outside, the excitement and firmness with which she holds your hand as she greets or welcomes you is the highlight of this gem character. This academic smartypants is comically so humble about it that if anyone questions her answer, she withdraws it inspite of always being right.","She correctly matches to the role of the ‘true doctor’ thanks to her smart brain and terrible handwriting. It is believed that her high scores have been due to the frustration of the examiner from reading her fully correct yet absolutely impossible calligraphy. Personally, she is a perfect friend and one worth trusting to keep things at heart. If anyone knows how to use silence rightly, here’s your girl."],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,760,560],[0,1723,760,547]],"kid":null,"sprite":"ruksana-p-m.webp","size":[760,2270],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[264,44,281,281]},{"slug":"saeba-susan-thomas","name":"Saeba Susan Thomas","text":["Arrived to CMC and found herself as the fish out of water, Saeba later dug a pond around her. Now she has made brackish waters of kerala her second home, her native home being any one of the ‘n’ number of countries her family is living at present. She has done the pioneering research in discovering a brand new malayalam accent for NRIs. Quite a lot of seniors, NRIs and locals alike tried to practise this art, failing miserably in the process.","These losers took their venegance in offering her ‘Chori’ during first year. Her smartness and fluency in English became a boon to 53rd in oratory contests. She knows how best to crack a joke and kickstart a conversation. Thus she can get along with anyone and stick around as a great friend: such is the goodness of her character. Saeba has also conquered all of our hearts with her magnificent voice and has bagged numerous prizes in western music for the batch.","“Chali” and “sleep” are the essential ingredients in her palette. The main reason why Mgrill’s delivery boy visits LH often is because of her love for tastes. She is someone who adores Italian pasta and Indian tandoori alike. She knows how to assume a multitude of roles, ranging from 20 yr old lady to a 70yr old ammama. All in all, Saeba is a vibrant personality"],"photos":[[0,611,666,664],[0,1275,760,497],[0,1772,760,566]],"kid":[0,2338,320,319],"sprite":"saeba-susan-thomas.webp","size":[760,2657],"portrait":[0,0,760,611],"face":[144,34,433,433]},{"slug":"safna-a-p","name":"Safna A P","text":["Short but sweet, this brown –eyed beauty queen of Malabar has conquered our hearts with her expertise in ‘vachakamadi’. She headed the batch ‘oppana’ team and walked away with the prize. How someone can remain that cool while getting involved in multiple tasks brings exclamation to our hearts. Her acting skills are familiar to CMC as ‘pathumma’, the skit-character who spoke in fluent Malappuram accent during Women’s day.","Though a tiny figure, she is known as ‘atom bomb’ because her ringing voice might damage your cochlea. She has the unique ability to mimick the gestures of not only her classmates, but also our professors and movie stars. She is the budding ‘Shreya Ghoshal’ of 53rd batch who is loved for singing Hindi songs, if any 53rd birdie needs mehandi call Safna. When asked something, her answers come with a wide smile loaded with a lot of sarcasm and comedy and when she asks you something, you end up speechless.","Her best response to anyone who asks her a tongue-tying question is ‘phaa’ (watch Philomina or Adoor Bhavani say the same in old Mallu movies). Power does not lie in one’s weight or height but in one’s tongue."],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,760,544],[0,1707,760,560]],"kid":[0,2267,320,320],"sprite":"safna-a-p.webp","size":[760,2587],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[301,54,233,233]},{"slug":"saify-samad","name":"Saify Samad","text":["“Chatthaaalum chamanj kidakkanam”. For Saify, beauty is everything. Entering college, she was a fair, plump, long haired girl. After several months of dieting experiments (which included meals once in a week) and unshakeable determination, she can now stand next to Deepika Padukone. ‘White family’ is her motto. Even radio mango helped in propagating Saify’s Prince concept -”Vellutha chullan”.","Mature-looking but childish and sensitive in nature, she is quick to quarrel and even quicker to patch up. Dancing and sleeping are her passions. Titled “notorious planner” -she plans her holidays a month ahead and adjusts other people’s timetables according to her schedule. Her sharp memory allows her to read Harrison once and reproduce it in a second. No girl in CMC has earned an archrival as Saify hasthe nasty, creepy Rat who spoiled her sidebag, purse, book and not to spare, her coat.","She had even attempted to murder it (similarising to “Sundaran” in “ee parakkum thalika”)although it escaped skilfully. This adorable lady doctor is an expected glimmering dietician to combat several modifiable life style diseases in the future."],"photos":[[0,612,760,560],[0,1172,657,671],[0,1843,760,557]],"kid":[0,2400,320,320],"sprite":"saify-samad.webp","size":[760,2720],"portrait":[0,0,760,612],"face":[266,52,197,197]},{"slug":"saikrishnan-v-k","name":"Saikrishnan V K","text":["He has one of the strangest nick names in our batch – “Andaavu” - and who knew reclaiming one’s lost possessions earned you one. What started out as a quiet and conserved play has turned out to be an all out rock show. It was slow at first, but as time passed by it picked up pace. So much pace that he has become one of the most carefree guys in our batch. Always brimming with positive energy, he keeps himself occupied always, while seeking out new fun ways to spend time with his friends.","But what makes him special is his helping mentality that has benefitted people both inside and outside the batch. It is hard to find someone like Sai, who goes way out of his comfort zone to help others and yet find happiness in it. Case in point: Take leave from your current posting to provide substi for a friend and in turn receive extension for the same. And he loves food, especially fruits: especially jackfruit.","And payasams of all kinds. Never sitting idle, he also likes to make trips, suggesting ideas out of the blue and riding off for a few days without notice with friends. All things said, it is impossible to find a guy with so much variety in our batch."],"photos":[],"kid":null},{"slug":"sinjitha-v-k","name":"Sinjitha V K","text":["“How does she maintain such amazing hair!!” Is the first question to pop up in our heads when we see this perfect looking model. Clenched in a neat bun, her long tresses have been a source of wonder to many. Although she is unaware of her good looks, others (especially the boys, junior, same or senior, irrespectively) are very well aware of it. And many have been found drooling at the sight of her walking past by.","Being the queen of “puccham”, her response is quick, honest and onthe-face. This bold beauty is outspoken and responds openly no matter who the person is. You can trust her for an unbiased opinion about anything. If we’ve ever seen one to respect time, she’s it, be the day or circumstance; be it breakfast or dinner or a normal working day. Her sleep is a talk-about, even on the eve of an exam, her head hits the pillow at 10pm sharp, and not even an explosion can wake her from her ever-famous universal flexion posture.","As rare as her name is, this smart girl is rightly said to be “one of a kind”."],"photos":[[0,601,760,560],[0,1161,760,557],[0,1718,760,560]],"kid":[0,2278,320,319],"sprite":"sinjitha-v-k.webp","size":[760,2597],"portrait":[0,0,760,601],"face":[83,171,372,372]},{"slug":"siyad-ahammad-p-p","name":"Siyad Ahammad P P","text":["He is the poster boy of Govt. Dental College, Calicut. Lauded as the miracle of Indian dentistry, the transformation of Dr. Siyad’s teeth remains one of the biggest achievements of our dental college. However nothing could be done to his voice which is often mistaken for the moan of a stoned dog. Known by several names like pallan, koker and other big (valiya) names not fit for publishing, Siyad is an exceptional person.","Talented as he is, his initial onstage performances including the famous “pocket mein rocket” and “ente murali” garnered rave critical reviews (from seniors and batchmates alike) and since, he has refused to go on stage. However his technical prowess coupled with DTP and poster designing powers (re – nizhalchithram) has been indispensible for every program the college has since seen.","He has a tendency to jump on literally any offer, be it a 10% discount for a shirt or a year of free entrance coaching in a previously unheard institute (story goes that he saw an ad for entrance coaching in a piece of paper used to pack the pazhamporis he bought with tea, and went for it once he saw the word free). Committed to the cause, you can count on him to finish what is expected of him.","Clever and genuinely friendly we can see him around the campus a bit more (owing to the maximum extensions he managed, even more than peripartum interns). Definitely he is not someone you are going to forget in near future."],"photos":[[0,606,760,559],[0,1165,760,560],[0,1725,760,560]],"kid":[0,2285,177,178],"sprite":"siyad-ahammad-p-p.webp","size":[760,2463],"portrait":[0,0,760,606],"face":[117,0,606,606]},{"slug":"smrithi-j-p","name":"Smrithi J P","text":["UTENESS OVERLOADED’ that’s the best title for our Miss Cute nominee “chimmi”. Ponnumkudatthinendhinaa pottu” -is exactly true for this girl, because inspite of her traditional Indian looks, she never wears a bindi!. Quite some self confidence right! She wears a beautiful, heart melting smile and is one of those born-beautiful girls who hasn’t a care in the world of how she looks to others.","Nevertheless, the energy that lies within this cute little doll has surprised many. She is ever-positive and never hesitates to motivate others. Personified by her cute puppet-walk, her soft sweet voice and comic giggle can beat the sunshine anyday. Although not a fashionista, she throttled the trendsetters of 53rd batch with her fearless introduction of the diamond nose stud, which many dedicatedly still follow just like the Ramleela earrings!","As a student, she is quite a hardworker and puts in much effort to prepare seminars. But mind you, she ensures that no one ever dares to sleep in her classes, because she will sweetly call the person’s name out and ask a difficult question. You would admire her patience had you ever had her explain something to you. Fun loving and adorable, this lovingly called ‘chimmi’ will never leave your heart once you know her."],"photos":[[0,608,760,560],[0,1168,586,671],[0,1839,760,370]],"kid":[0,2209,320,320],"sprite":"smrithi-j-p.webp","size":[760,2529],"portrait":[0,0,760,608],"face":[112,7,556,556]},{"slug":"sona-s","name":"Sona S","text":["Though her height is on the taller side, Sona is one of the youngest people of 53rd batch. How she grew up from being an IUGR baby to a strong-willed, smart and intelligent lady is a matter of curiosity. Compliment her that she looks like her mother and she will remember you for the rest of her life. Punctual to both clinics and PG classes, Sona knows best how to manage work and studies side by side.","She could have become a civil servant or an engineer or anything else she chose to become, but Sona sought the path of medicine because of her sheer passion for serving humanity. Any new book release will hit her shelf in no time. An avid Harry Potter dan, Sona has read and reread the entire JK Rowling series. Always found in the second row, she has been a victim to every teacher’s pointed questions, but she survived them with grace and poise every single time.","Outside of academics, Sona is a passionate quizzer and a whistler! If you hear someone whistling the latest Malayalam songs in CMC, chances are that she is Sona!"],"photos":[[0,603,760,558],[0,1161,760,560],[0,1721,760,560]],"kid":[0,2281,315,320],"sprite":"sona-s.webp","size":[760,2601],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[324,75,250,250]},{"slug":"sona-vijay","name":"Sona Vijay","text":["Perfectionist would be the right word to describe this sharp-featured walking encyclopedia. An amazing writer and an evolving movie buff, this girl can spend hours on the well sought bench of our college garden dreaming and creating a different world of her own. Her authoritative notions on current affairs and innumerous tidbits of information about absolutely anything under the sun can leave you awe-stricken.","It would be incomplete to not mention how error proof, neat and meticulous this nature-lover is. Many higher authorities have even come a long way to request for her multicoloured calligraphy for various official and unofficial purposes. Rumour has it that Microsoft is dying to get her for her handwriting to introduce a new font in Microsoft word. While 2009 showed us a perfect school girl whose only other interest seemed to be quizzing, 6 years down the lane, we now see a spontaneous, fun-loving, explorative lover of travelling and needless to say an amazing friend to many.","But beware if anger is a spark, then this girl is an explosion and you wouldn’t want to get onto her nerves. What makes her most special? She is the SUPERWOMAN to any friend in need. This outspoken soul is definitely one to look out for in the books of medicine, literature or even history!"],"photos":[[0,604,760,547],[0,1151,760,564],[0,1715,760,560]],"kid":[0,2275,320,320],"sprite":"sona-vijay.webp","size":[760,2595],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[342,38,418,418]},{"slug":"soorya-k","name":"Soorya K","text":["The perfect example to “looks can be deceptive”, because when she first walked into class we thought of her as miss tough but a squeaky “kunjuvava” voice erupted out of her vocal cords and we were stuck with awe. This academic scholar is the most dynamic, super organized lady rep of 53rd. Her room is the mini library of CMC, because she has various books of each and every subject.","She has been applauded (and still is) for her outstanding leadership qualities and capabilities in ordering and organizing. Perfect in co ordination, quick to act and smart to dig up solutions, Soorya does not like things going out of line. She aims and achieves her target come what may. It is rumoured that she leads a gangster group to beat up everyone who messes up wit her, although recent spy work revealed that the hidden origin of this gang was from a kindergarten in Payyannur.","Of the well known companies chasing her, fabercastle stands first because she owns more highlighter markers than the company itself. Want the next female president? Here is your one!!"],"photos":[[0,614,585,671],[0,1285,760,559],[0,1844,760,437]],"kid":[0,2281,320,318],"sprite":"soorya-k.webp","size":[760,2599],"portrait":[0,0,760,614],"face":[112,117,229,229]},{"slug":"sreedevi-s-nair","name":"Sreedevi S Nair","text":["rShe is the “Palakkadan Pandi” of her gang and very dedicatedly follows it with her nose stud, fluorescent colour choices and Palakkadan slang. She is a brain head and grasps anything that she reads in a minute’s time. Her passionate love of books coupled with a messy bed is her world, where you can often find her in partial universal flexion furiously poking at her phone to finish a virtual village game.","Being nocturnal, her day begins when others sleep and it’s amazing that she can still be early to rise. Fiercely independant, she holds strong likes and dislikes. Her ‘size zero waist’, craze for various branded Kajals and antique earrings, love for dance and wide expressive eyes are inevitable highlights. Nostalgically in love with this college as her mother studied here, she loves teaching, preparing seminars and exploring new things.","Simply speaking, here’s living proof that ‘big brains can come in small packages’."],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,711,524],[0,1687,760,560]],"kid":[0,2247,320,318],"sprite":"sreedevi-s-nair.webp","size":[760,2565],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[341,67,362,362]},{"slug":"sreeshma-varghese","name":"Sreeshma Varghese","text":["“Changaathi nannaayal kannaadi venda”- this was made for our beloved ‘cheechu’.’Cheechu amma’ though one of the younger ones of our batch, is known for her motherly care and comforting nature. Be it exams or a party, this devotee will never miss her prayers; rightly titled:”Palliyum pattakarum pinne’ kunjaadum’”. Her helpful attitude earned her the title “paropakari”, which often ended up in her singing ‘Avanavan kuzhikuna kurukazhichedkumbol gulumal’.","Her superb pronunciations forced Oxford to rewrite its phonetics under the title “Maggi Madaama’s spoken english”. Her soulmate being acne; A million ayurvedic and chemical creams later, she finally became the brand ambassador of Clean and Clear in CMC! Her 7 ‘long’ strands of hair and ‘naadan’ looks remind us of Karuttha ‘Malar’. Ironic to being an angel, this horror movie freak can sit alone in the spooks of the night and excitedly greet a dead monster.","This yoga master of 53rd with her sweet voice, acting and dance skills has mesmerised many. Silent outside and violent inside. Thats our cheechu."],"photos":[[0,613,633,467],[0,1080,668,490],[0,1570,382,671]],"kid":[0,2241,320,320],"sprite":"sreeshma-varghese.webp","size":[760,2561],"portrait":[0,0,760,613],"face":[122,0,357,357]},{"slug":"sruthi-haridas","name":"Sruthi Haridas","text":["Great things come in small packages. Oh no, great things come in really tiny packages. That is Sruthi Haridas. She is the kind of person who orders ‘rice and sambar’ even at Taj Hotel. Please don’t mistake it for humility. She does so because nothing less than a pot of rice and a pint of sambar can satisfy her appetite. How she manages to keep a size zero figure even after taking so much enteral nutrition is a million dollar question open for research.","Sruthi is an extremely talented artist who has single handedly led the batch in all designing competitions. Her greatest weakness is that she can’t say “no” to anyone. Though people will mistakenly assume that Sruthi cannot work hard, she is known to be a ferocious fast-mover in the wards. Recently, a dermatologist knocked at the door of her heart. When the door opened for him, what he found was rainbow colours of love."],"photos":[[0,614,760,560],[0,1174,760,505],[0,1679,666,491]],"kid":[0,2170,320,320],"sprite":"sruthi-haridas.webp","size":[760,2490],"portrait":[0,0,760,614],"face":[273,31,195,195]},{"slug":"sruthin-s-valsan","name":"Sruthin S Valsan","text":["It is a cool windy afternoon in February. A tall, lean lanky kid is leading around 31 girls for his birthday treat. There’s not a single boy in the vicinity. That is the good old Romeo of 53rd batch, Sruthin S Valsan, or popularly known as Maman. Soft spoken and sweet tongued, there are few who are not charmed by him. To the pointlessly wandering, innocent minds of 53rd boys, he showed a new way of life and that made them taller, stronger and sharper.","An ardent movie buff, he has watched all of IMDB’s top 250 movies. Along with his brilliant team mates, he is a part of the legendary, unbeatable Dumbcharades team of our batch. He is the center of every celebration that ever took place in the batch. Always caring, and rooting for his friends, he is an ideal companion to have. This lazy, yet cheerful man has been, and always will be everyone’s mate."],"photos":[[0,610,760,551],[0,1161,760,560],[0,1721,760,556]],"kid":[0,2277,320,320],"sprite":"sruthin-s-valsan.webp","size":[760,2597],"portrait":[0,0,760,610],"face":[150,0,610,610]},{"slug":"sruthi-p","name":"Sruthi P","text":["With the baggage of academic excellence and sports championship, this Kannur native is an epitome of simplicity. Her ambitions and dreams being limited to the boundaries of her hometown and college, she expects less and is thus content and ever happy. Born to a family flooded with teachers, her mother taught her in Kindergarten; Her father was her principal in middle school and high school. (we are still searching for her relatives in CMC!) Neat, tidy, an hour early and very diplomatic, her warm nature easily invites people to thread along her friend’s chain.","She made her mark in CMC’s literature with her bold “love letter writing”. (We wonder who she really wrote it to!) Easy to persuade, easy to jest with, easy to go blue, easy to console-everything is ‘easy’ with her; probably thats why her friends call her “one hell of a choice for the ultimate friend”!"],"photos":[[0,613,482,582],[0,1195,760,560],[0,1755,760,488]],"kid":null,"sprite":"sruthi-p.webp","size":[760,2243],"portrait":[0,0,760,613],"face":[132,24,418,418]},{"slug":"surumi-m","name":"Surumi M","text":["She dissected with D batch, learned clinical medicine with B batch, attended practical exams with C batch, all because of a single alphabet ‘M’ that may precede or succeed her beautiful name, Surumi. Well, she never had any qualms about it, but she seemed to enjoy this golden opportunity. No wonder why she is a pet to most of all people of 53rd. She is like glue to paper, always flexible and willing to adjust to any new situation.","So silent, but very pleasant, she is not known to complain or show grudge to anyone. She stays light years away from chatterbox status. When she speaks out, she does it judiciously, and makes her point clear. Very sincere and efficient Surumi often gets unnoticed in the group because of the silence oftentimes, but she is an invaluable addition to any group outing.’ No’ is the word that is absent in her dictionary, and she welcomes any hard task with an approving nod.","The real home sick Surumi is rarely spotted in hostel because she cannot resist going home every day. Strong at heart and soft outside, she can overcome tough times with her sheer will power."],"photos":[[0,613,270,371],[0,984,760,560],[0,1544,760,507],[0,2051,760,560]],"kid":null,"sprite":"surumi-m.webp","size":[760,2611],"portrait":[0,0,760,613],"face":[180,24,530,530]},{"slug":"swathy-krishnan","name":"Swathy Krishnan","text":["Flawlessly sculpted, aristocratic and twine thin, this graceful beauty is nowhere near the usual normal. Despite the multitude of expressions that a girl is blessed to carry, she has her own crop of uninterested impossible expressions, popularly referred to as “Nissangabhaavam”, which unfortunately is her signature! Her God-given talent to learn even amidst a full blaring crowd, is well known.","It has amazed many as to how a girl with nil ‘vivaram’ turns daughter to Hutchison and Harrison just 2 days prior to an exam! Even better, she can capsule-size anything she learns and is the best to talk to for a revision just before entering the exam hall. Amidst all this chaos, Swathi dedicatedly keeps up her sincerity to her ‘mirror addiction’ and loves admiring her face in it at every possible angle.","Her cute ponytail, graceful smile and bollywood features have turned many heads; and for all we know, if not a doctor, a supermodel is what Swathi shouldve been!"],"photos":[[0,613,552,671],[0,1284,760,560],[0,1844,503,669]],"kid":[0,2513,280,279],"sprite":"swathy-krishnan.webp","size":[760,2792],"portrait":[0,0,760,613],"face":[89,12,471,471]},{"slug":"swetha-sankar-p","name":"Swetha Sankar P","text":["Soft spoken as she is, this cute girl is known deeply only by her nearbies and yet has grabbed much attention with her heartwarming smile and gentle talk. Technically described as “bedridden”, she leaves her bed only for class, food and to the call of nature! Though many define her to be in the ultimatum of laziness, she casually considers it a way of life. Being the hardcore internet browser she is, her lack of conversing with others has never crumpled her; for she can still raise her head from her phonescreen with attitude and ramble on about the latest gossips, who’s with who, why and where!","Her fashion sense has made her a noticeable one with her cotton salwars and schiffon shawls in their mix and match colours. Her love of shopping never to be forgotten is classic. Because unlike many other smartshoppers, she somehow chooses a fabric whose price and look are well at war with each other. Silent yet a smile-winner, thats our Swetha!"],"photos":[[0,613,760,560],[0,1173,760,561],[0,1734,760,560]],"kid":[0,2294,320,317],"sprite":"swetha-sankar-p.webp","size":[760,2611],"portrait":[0,0,760,613],"face":[147,22,484,484]},{"slug":"syam-s-kumar","name":"Syam S Kumar","text":["‘Kumz parly’ also known as Syam S Kumar is the ultimate family man. Literally a ‘nanma maram’, he is like the hero of a Sathyan Anthikkad movie, but in the face of injustice he becomes the hero of a Shaji Kailas movie. He has little twinge of regret in joining MBBS because he says he is of high intellect rather than just rot learning. He is also said to resemble a number of actors – Unnimukundan, Duggu, Prithviraj, Thala, the list goes on.","All that aside, he is undoubtedly the best guy one can ever come across. Responsible, romantic, hardworking, sophisticated, and helpful, he is indeed the Mr. Perfect of our batch. His love for food is quite famous and some of his peculiar tastes can be summarized by “kuttiyillenkilum enikk rotti venam; koode oru rambootanum.” Over the years he has been an important cog in the political clockwork of SFI.","Under his leadership, NSS has conducted one of the best medical camps in NSS history. Syam is what you call the real deal; a truly great person, the best friend, the best brother, and the best son."],"photos":[[0,604,677,499],[0,1103,760,565],[0,1668,760,560]],"kid":[0,2228,320,320],"sprite":"syam-s-kumar.webp","size":[760,2548],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[151,30,437,437]},{"slug":"tarun-luke-simon","name":"Tarun Luke Simon","text":["Give him a pen and a piece of paper and the first thing he will do is draw a margin. It does not matter whether it is an imposition or a lecture note; Tarun draws a margin even for culture forms. Voted Mr. Well dressed in first year, we cannot spot him in the campus without a tucked in shirt and polished shoes. He might easily be the guy with the largest wardrobe in our batch owing to the frequent Australian cargo shipping he receives.","Always well groomed, disciplined and soft spoken, his personality made him a silent heartthrob of many. Diplomacy is in his blood and we hardly ever see him arguing with any one. Being a dayscholar, he always envied hostel and a hosteller’s life which we could just make out in his frequent statement, “njanonnumarinjilleda; njanhostelilallalo”. That said, this great guy has been a true friend and a great companion to many, and his smiling face will be just a call away for any help."],"photos":[[0,396,760,560],[0,956,760,563],[0,1519,760,560]],"kid":[0,2079,320,317],"sprite":"tarun-luke-simon.webp","size":[760,2396],"portrait":[0,0,492,396],"face":[117,15,374,374]},{"slug":"teena-kurian","name":"Teena Kurian","text":["Cute. Chubby. Bubbly. Teena has enough cute members in her family to run a beauty contest. It is not your mistake if she reminds you of Goldilocks from your fairy tale book. Being a half day scholar and half hosteler, she got to enjoy the duck curry from home and ‘chicken chukka’ from ‘Biriyani hut ‘at the same time. You will love Teena for the chatterbox she is. Though she will enthusiastiacally join you for dinner, she generally satisfies her appetite with a guava juice.","Before and after food, she will declare that she is on a diet. When her ears turn red, you know that she is angry; so better to stay away. In one minute, she enacts Nagavalli and in the next, she becomes calm and poised. Teena and her gang have a natural instinct for attracting attention, especially of bachelor men. However, innocent Teena is too busy grooming herself that she fails to notice these dangling carrots.","Going by her family history, it is for sure that she won’t stop anywhere shorter than a PG."],"photos":[[0,620,760,560],[0,1180,760,560],[0,1740,760,560]],"kid":[0,2300,315,316],"sprite":"teena-kurian.webp","size":[760,2616],"portrait":[0,0,760,620],"face":[152,15,503,503]},{"slug":"unnikrishnan-e-s","name":"Unnikrishnan E S","text":["“So… tell me the names of 5 European countries?” “Oh! ithreyullu?? itha pidicho – England, France, Liverpool, Brunei” “Who is the father of our nation?” “ippazhatheyano?.....:-) “ne can quote a hundred such incidents about our Unnikrishnan. Always smiling, always joyful, his pleasant mood is infectious. This might be the reason he has roots right from 42nd batch to 57th batch.","Rich, handsome and extremely likeable he can make you feel like you have known him for years. However, his friend zone is somewhat polarized towards 2 year seniors and 2 year juniors than our own batch. One of the best dancers in the batch, he has been an integral part of the College dance team. He has always introduced us to new technology like the 1st touch phone, the 1st S2, the 1st iphone, the 1st alienware and what not.","Completely selfless and caring, his friends are indeed lucky to have known him and lived with him."],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,760,563],[0,1726,760,560]],"kid":[0,2286,320,320],"sprite":"unnikrishnan-e-s.webp","size":[760,2606],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[138,153,404,404]},{"slug":"uwais-p","name":"Uwais P","text":["The Mr. Batch runner up of 53rd is no stranger to the CMCians. Batch rep, General Captain and winner of several badminton tournaments, Uwais is one mega package of 53rd batch and CMC in general. His fire power however diminishes when it comes to arriving on time, be it the lecture hall or examination hall, Uwais will be the last man to enter. Uwais is also a heartthrob among the girls and the ultimate oppanamanavaalan of our batch.","You can’t always trust his smile though; “chirichkondupanikodukkum” is what his pals say. The king of diplomacy, he can offer you poison and make it sound like he is offering you an elixir of immortality. Marriage has been the ultimate turning point in this man’s life; once ever present in hostel, he is now barely seen thanks to his everyday ventures to spend time with his “missus”.","A fun filled character who is always nice to be with, born to live life at its fullest."],"photos":[[0,603,760,560],[0,1163,760,556],[0,1719,640,635]],"kid":null,"sprite":"uwais-p.webp","size":[760,2354],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[334,31,393,393]},{"slug":"vaisakh-krishnan-p-a","name":"Vaisakh Krishnan P A","text":["“Didi …aap badi ladki kab ban gayi”, asks our Varanasi brought up hero to raucous laughter from his unitmates. That is Vaisakh Krishnan or Vaikri for you. Jovial, fun loving, and compassionate, he is extremely passionate about anything he does and his girlfriend Martina, her brother Kurt and how he tamed them with the help of Youtube is a living proof of that. One half of his life is full of black and white stripes.","A hardcore Newcastle United fan, Alan Shearer is his living god. The other half is made of strings, drums and Chris Martin. An ardent fan of Coldplay, it is his life mission to watch them perform live. He also wouldn’t mind if he dies and goes to a rock hell with Freddie Mercury, Kurt Cobain and John Lennon. Even though a European accidently born in a remote village in Palakkad, his heart is Indian through and through.","Vaikri, his strings and his husky voice has touched all our hearts."],"photos":[[0,603,681,501],[0,1104,718,671],[0,1775,760,565]],"kid":[0,2340,320,320],"sprite":"vaisakh-krishnan-p-a.webp","size":[760,2660],"portrait":[0,0,760,603],"face":[266,119,224,224]},{"slug":"vaisakh-v-k","name":"Vaisakh V K","text":["From Padmarajan to Lalit Modi, the roles VK has adopted in these 6 years of College life is simply jaw dropping. And who can forget his masterpiece “Nizhalchithrangal”, one of the highlights of our CMC days. Hardworker, highly competitive, committed and multi-talented, VK is one of the most popular guys in the batch. Also notorious to crack unbearable chalis, you are sure to have a good laugh when this guy is around.","All in all a colorful, joyful, mixed bag and a guy unlike any other."],"photos":[[0,609,677,499],[0,1108,760,560],[0,1668,760,494]],"kid":[0,2162,315,320],"sprite":"vaisakh-v-k.webp","size":[760,2482],"portrait":[0,0,760,609],"face":[409,166,197,197]},{"slug":"vandana-p","name":"Vandana P","text":["Ms. Django of 53rd, she has undoubtedly lived upto the title which was bestowed upon her during first year. Eventhough the inherent slowness has led to her being inadvertantly depicted as the epitome of abulia, she prefers to make an analogy to eryx the quintessential being, who gets caught up in untoward situations, just because of the lack of pace. She is a real storyteller with a knack of attracting real life dramatic situations, and with a flair of describing them with a wide expressive eyes and elaborate gestures-she has great future in ‘kathaprasangam’.","Behind that facade of djangoism and apparent carelessness, she is a curious and optimistic being. She is the kind of person who will curiously inspect the ‘iditheey’ which has just fallen on her. Above all, she is a friend who will stand by your side under any circumstance."],"photos":[[0,613,760,560],[0,1173,609,535],[0,1708,455,351]],"kid":[0,2059,320,320],"sprite":"vandana-p.webp","size":[760,2379],"portrait":[0,0,760,613],"face":[93,17,501,501]},{"slug":"varada-p","name":"Varada P","text":["Smartness and cuteness blended in one: that is Varada. She has the uncanning ability of making ‘fans’ wherever she goes. From the mobile phone vender to the professor in medicineeverybody is Varada’s fan. We suspect that she’ll be the first CMC-ian to have a ‘fan club’. She has the notorious honor of being the script writer of CMC’s show in Akashavani. Varada is a veggie by habit.","Several CMCs had the auspices of having her as the prayer girl. As long as someone is ready to push the rear of her scooter, she is willing to give them a ride, Whether it be in cheroopa or CMC, she has a long line of PPs waiting for her second opinion. Being a first bencher during first year, she has shared her notes with almost every physiology PG. She is a typical day-ski who has never stayed away from home even for entrance preps.","If you find goodness radiating from someone, you know it is Varada."],"photos":[[0,617,760,560],[0,1177,374,276],[0,1453,760,645]],"kid":[0,2098,317,320],"sprite":"varada-p.webp","size":[760,2418],"portrait":[0,0,760,617],"face":[134,22,492,492]},{"slug":"varsha-somasundaran","name":"Varsha Somasundaran","text":["Where there is Varsha there is brightness. She is the Alice who rules her wonderland. A hundred expressions flash on her face during conversation within minutes. She is the only girl in CMC whose demeanor has been compared to the maximum number of movie actresses. She is so versatile that in one moment she is an ‘aanamandu’ and in the next, a well –versed clinician. The advantage of having a ‘Thalasserikkari’ as the roommate is the continuous supply of mouth watering food, Varsha’s roommates are the luckiest of all.","She is late for every wedding because she has to dress up & makeover everyone around, including the bride herself. She is the last word for all your questions related to designing. Innocence and caring is in her blood. She is called the “butterfly” of 53rd batch for all the fluttering she does. Though people suggest ‘complan’ to this “kuttyvarsha”, she refuses to grow up."],"photos":[[0,556,681,502],[0,1058,760,560],[0,1618,662,454]],"kid":[0,2072,320,320],"sprite":"varsha-somasundaran.webp","size":[760,2392],"portrait":[0,0,689,556],"face":[158,35,222,222]},{"slug":"varsha-v-p","name":"Varsha V P","text":["Tall, lean, oval faced and with an ever gorgeous smile, here is 53rd’s light hearted darling from the bright greens of Palakkad. Eventhough a single child, living with her bunch of funfilled cousins has helped her carry the essence of sharing and caring. Making entry into CMC as a fair, plump, less fashionable normal girl, she has plummeted to the glory of being a beauty with enviable curves and a sharp, pretty face in the last 6 years.","Ironic to her confused appearance, this girl carries the stamina to take bold decisions and handle big responsibilities with much ease and perfection. Easy to adjust with, cool to hangout with and the first to get excited, she is a beautiful blend of excitement and subtleness in equal amounts. Being the last one to sulk, nothing can wipe off that smile from this pretty one’s face; Perhaps thats why she stole many hearts, the strongest being that of our (her) own batchmate’s.","Towering yet graceful as she walks, thats 53rd’s Varsha. V. P."],"photos":[[0,611,760,560],[0,1171,760,563],[0,1734,760,561]],"kid":[0,2295,320,320],"sprite":"varsha-v-p.webp","size":[760,2615],"portrait":[0,0,760,611],"face":[207,30,342,342]},{"slug":"vaseel-m","name":"Vaseel M","text":["This is a guy who loves to keep a tie with the past. The daily reminder that goes off in his cell phone evry night at 12 to go to ‘sadma’ is a perfect example for that. The kung-fu king who is the only proven martial arts master in our batch. Enemies beware! He can kick the life out of you. Daily honing of his skills in the tv room is a sight to behold. You can never imagine what he can do.","His unit mates say that he has a habit of disappearing suddenly to some unknown hide outs in between the postings. One wonders whether it is to practice a few of his kung fu steps, or is it due to a sudden urge of home sickness. Always taking a stand in any issue, and always with different perspectives to a topic, he is an interesting guy to have a discussion with, be it any topic.","Selfless and caring, he is always ready to lend himself for any help, and is indeed a treasure for his friends."],"photos":[[0,606,760,560],[0,1166,760,556],[0,1722,760,560]],"kid":[0,2282,212,212],"sprite":"vaseel-m.webp","size":[760,2494],"portrait":[0,0,760,606],"face":[207,26,366,366]},{"slug":"vidya-k-m","name":"Vidya K M","text":["A chattebox cum atom bomb. Don’t underestimate her for her size. On the very first days, people thought of her as the precedent of the British Queen, but later on we realized that she fits in smartly as one among us. Now we know her as a caring friend, who goes to any extent to protect her flock. Lucky are those beings who got to be her best friends. She is popular for her “ramp walk” and junky-flunky wardrobe.","She is definitely the one who is being hunted by designers for new apparel ideas Once upon a time, juniors stayed miles away from her because of her ‘naikurana’ special chori, but now she has been spotted with several juniors in cafes and wards. We assume that she is now on her way to become the most adorable person for juniors and PGs alike. A die hard fan of Hritik Roshan, Vidya can dance like her idol too!","She would beat Bill Gates for her rich collection of nicknames. She almost never returns from a ward without earning a new nickname. Being a great motivator and a real responsible person she is, Vidya works hard to make everything the best ever."],"photos":[[0,609,760,560],[0,1169,760,472],[0,1641,536,671]],"kid":[0,2312,320,320],"sprite":"vidya-k-m.webp","size":[760,2632],"portrait":[0,0,760,609],"face":[128,33,254,254]},{"slug":"viju-john-v-n","name":"Viju John V N","text":["The typical Trivandrum guy, street smart, Viju john has an amazing ability to make lasting relations be it the post graduates or batch mates or juniors. Viju’s ability to mingle with the females is certainly worth mentioning as he is often found surrounded by ladies be it juniors or seniors. No wonder why his friends enviously quote him as “Paavangalude Fahad Fazil”. Viju is also the heartbeat of the Jesus youth CMC and has gone a long way in uniting the Trivandrum folk in CMC being the admin of a Trivandrum Whatsapp group.","Ever in need for a film? Contact this guy who is well known for his huge collection of movies. Fun filled, pleasant and good tempered, you always get a good vibe when this guy is around."],"photos":[[0,605,515,625],[0,1230,760,567],[0,1797,575,424]],"kid":null,"sprite":"viju-john-v-n.webp","size":[760,2221],"portrait":[0,0,760,605],"face":[187,105,290,290]},{"slug":"vineeth-skariah-abraham","name":"Vineeth Skariah Abraham","text":["The best and most precious gems are always hidden. That is just the case of this gem of our batch. He may not be the most popular or well-known guy in our batch. But his closest friends only get to know his value. A big fan of Sylvester Stallone and a boxing enthusiast, contact this guy if you are in need of some inspiration. Known as ‘Visky’ among his buddies, he also loves cricket and closely follows the sport, the Proteas and AB de Villiers in particular.","Cool, calm and collected, he is one of the few gentlemen of the batch."],"photos":[[0,612,760,549],[0,1161,624,460],[0,1621,760,560]],"kid":null,"sprite":"vineeth-skariah-abraham.webp","size":[760,2181],"portrait":[0,0,760,612],"face":[183,30,378,378]},{"slug":"vipin-k","name":"Vipin K","text":["The grand tall man of 53rd, fondly known as ‘thotti’ among his friends. The only Malayali house surgeon who watch Telugu films without subtitles, he is the President of all Kerala Mahesh Babu Fans association, medical college branch. He says he bear an uncanny resemblance to Telugu star ‘Prabhas’, but no one has unfortunately seconded those claims. An extremely out door person, he is a good athlete.","With a penchant for gund syndromes and rare diseases, he is one of the best in academics, and always ends up in the better end of the rank list. He was second in the IAP paediatrics quiz competing with several other academic mammoths. Whatever be the case, he will be ready to kill for his friends, just like his loyal friends who are ready to welcome a month extension with open arms for him."],"photos":[[0,604,627,462],[0,1066,760,545],[0,1611,760,560]],"kid":[0,2171,320,320],"sprite":"vipin-k.webp","size":[760,2491],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[247,177,152,152]},{"slug":"vivek-k","name":"Vivek K","text":["When it comes to BHUJIs of our batch, Vivek is the ultimate. Vivek is one guy in the batch who is a born doctor. Hardworking, committed and passionate about medicine, Vivek is also one of the few guys around who shares his knowledge and is never shy to lend a helping hand to any batchmate who asks him a doubt or two. It would be unfair to say that everyone in the batch passed at their own merit since Vivek helped most of us at some point of time in studies.","As a friend, Vivek is irreplaceable, selfless, committed and kind. He is also passionate about cricket and is a regular follower of the sport. Vivek is what you call the perfect package."],"photos":[[0,608,760,560],[0,1168,760,557],[0,1725,760,563]],"kid":null,"sprite":"vivek-k.webp","size":[760,2288],"portrait":[0,0,760,608],"face":[182,0,410,410]},{"slug":"vysakh-ambadi","name":"Vysakh Ambadi","text":["It sure didn’t take long for this glamour kid to grab the attention of the female folk; everyone knew for certain who their Mr53rd would be - Ambadi. Hot headed and attractive, he is what you call an angry young man. On the softer side, Ambadi is a romantic guy who enjoys soft songs, in particular, Malayalam melodies and has enacted unforgettable roles in ‘Nizhalchithrangal’ and the drama ‘Ravunni’.","Perfectionist and a purist, Ambadi is also a crick-head, and is one of the best cricketers in the batch and the fastest bowler. Saurav Ganguly is his biggest inspiration. His nadan streak can be seen in his love for Jayaram, and idli. He is also the mama’s boy; adventure is certainly not his thing. Despite widespread allegations that Ambadi’s oilless diet is to preserve his charming skin, he still continues to follow a stringent and disciplined diet and lifestyle.","That just sums up the perfectionist of 53rd – Ambadi."],"photos":[[0,604,707,521],[0,1125,703,518],[0,1643,760,546]],"kid":null,"sprite":"vysakh-ambadi.webp","size":[760,2189],"portrait":[0,0,760,604],"face":[178,64,269,269]}];
